<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">41. Soli Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Mateyo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mulumbe Waina wa Yesu Klistu walalembwa ne Mateyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mateyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mateyo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mulumbe Waina wa Yesu Klistu walalembwa ne</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mateyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Busansulushi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mulumbe Waina walalembwa ne Mateyo ulatwambilinga Mulumbe wakwambeti Yesu eMupulushi Walaiwa kupitila mulyendiye,Lesa walakwanilisha malayano ngwalapangana ne bantu bakendi mucipangano cakaindi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Uwu Mulumbe ntewo wa bayuda bonka sobwe, mumukowa mwalasemenwa Yesu kayi nekukula, nsombi ni mulumbe wa cishi conse. Libuku lya Mateyo lyabambwa cena, lilatatikinga ne kusemwa kwa Yesu, shalubatisho lwa Yesu, sha masunko a Yesu, incito shakendi shakusengula mu Galileya, kayi ne shakwiyisha. Kufumapo lilambanga sha bulwendo bwakendi bwakufuma mu Galileya kuya ku Yelusalemu, kayi ne byalenshika nsondo imo kunyuma katanapopwa,kayi ne sha kupunduka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Uwu Mulumbe ulamwambangeti Yesu eshikwiyisha mukulene, ukute bwendeleshi bwakusansulula cena Milawo ya Lesa, kayi ukute kwiyisha cena sha Bwami bwa Lesa. Kwiyisha kwakendi ingatukubunganisha mu mbasu shisanu. 1 Ciyisho capamulundu cilambanga pabwikalo,incito, kayi ne colwe cakuya kwikala mu Bwami bwa Kwilu (5-7). 2 Malailile kuli batumwa likumi ne babili, ne bulwendo bwabo (10). 3 Pa mikoshano ilambanga sha Bwami bwa Kwilu (13). Ciyisho cancinencine ca Ncito ya batumwa, kayi ne ciyisho pamasuba ano akupwililisha amusemano uno, ne kwisa kwa Bwami bwa Lesa (24-25).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya makani</para>
  <para style="io1">Bamashali bakulukulu ne kusemwa kwa Yesu Klistu (1:1; 2:23).</para>
  <para style="io1">Incito sha Yohane Mubatishi, 3:1-12.</para>
  <para style="io1">Lubatisho ne kusunkwa kwa Yesu, 3:13 mpaka 4:11.</para>
  <para style="io1">Incito sha Yesu mu Galileya, 4:11 mpaka 18:35.</para>
  <para style="io1">Bulwendo bwa kufuma mu Galileya kuya ku Yelusalemu, 21:1 mpaka 27:66.</para>
  <para style="io1">Kupunduka ne kubonekela kwa Mwami 28:1-20.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Bamashali bakulukulu ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Uwu e mulongo wa bamashali bakulukulu ba Yesu, mushukulu wa Dafeti, uyo walikuba mushukulu wa Abulahamu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Abulahamu walasema Isake, nendi Isake walasema Yakobo, Nendi Yakobo walasema Yuda ne bakwabo, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yuda walasema Pelesi ne Sela muli Tamala, Pelesi walasema Hesiloni, Nendi Hesiloni walasema Lamu, <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lamu walasema Aminadabu, nendi Aminadabu walasema Nasoni, nendi Nasoni walasema Salumoni, <verse number="5" style="v"/>Salumoni walasema Bowasi muli Lahabi, nendi Bowasi walasema Obedi muli Lute, nendi Obedi walasema Jesi, <verse number="6" style="v"/>Jesi walasema Mwami Dafeti, nendi Dafeti walasema Solomoni mu mukashi walikuba wa Uliya. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Solomoni walasema Lehabyamu, nendi Lehabyamu walasema Abiya, nendi Abiya walasema Asa, <verse number="8" style="v"/>nendi Asa walasema Yehosafati, nendi Yehosafati walasema Yolamu, nendi Yolamu walasema Usiya, <verse number="9" style="v"/>Usiya walasema Yotamu, Nendi Yotamu walasema Ahazi, Nendi Ahazi walasema Hezekiya, <verse number="10" style="v"/>nendi Hezekiya walasema Manase, nendi Manase walasema Amoni, nendi Amoni walasema Yosiya, <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yosiya walasema Yekoniya ne bakwabo pacindi bana Baisilayeli mpobalikumantwa busha ku Babulo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Baisilayeli mpobalamantwa busha ku Babulo, Yekoniya walasema Salatiyele nendi Salatiyele walasema Zelubabele, <verse number="13" style="v"/>nendi Zelubabele walasema Abiyudi, Abiyudi walasema Eliyakimu nendi Eliyakimu walasema Asolo, <verse number="14" style="v"/>Asolo walasema Sadoki, nendi Sadoki walasema Akimu, nendi Akimu walasema Eliyudi, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nendi Eliyudi walasema Eliyasala, nendi Eliyasala walasema Matani, Matani walasema Yakobo, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nendi Yakobo walasema Yosefe ibendi Maliya, uyu Maliya e walasema Yesu lakwiwangeti Klistu Mupulushi Walaiwa usa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Neco, kufuma pali Abulahamu kushika pali Mwami Dafeti, palikuba misemano likumi ne ina, kayi kufuma pali Mwami Dafeti kushika pacindi bana ba Isilayeli mpobalamantwa busha kuya ku Babulo, napo palikuba misemano likumi ne ina, kayi kufuma pacindi ca kumantwa busha ku Babulo kushika pacindi ca Klistu, napo palikuba misemano likumi ne ina.</para>
  <para style="s">Kusemwa kwa Yesu Klistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lino kusemwa kwa Yesu Klistu kwalenshika munshila iyi. Pacindi Maliya banyina Yesu mpobalikuba bamamikilwa kuli Yosefe. Nomba kabatana baya kumalili, Maliya walacanika ne libunda kupitila mu ngofu ya Mushimu Uswepa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yosefe walikuba muntu walulama, nkalayanda kumusebanya pantangalala, walayeya kupwisha bubambo bwa cikwati kwakubula kwishiba bantu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kaciyeya cakwinsa mungelo wa Mwami Lesa walamubonekela muciloto ne kumwambileti, “Yosefe mwanendi Dafeti kotatina kumumanta Maliya kuba mukashobe, ili libunda ndyakute ni ngofu ya Mushimu Uswepa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nakatumbuke mwana mutuloba uyo ngoshi mukatumbe lina eti Yesu, pakwinga nakapulushe bantu bakendi ku bwipishi bwabo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ibi byalenshika kwalikuba kukwanilisha ncalamba Mwami kumushinshimi kwambeti <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Mulindu nakabe ne libunda ne kutumbuka mwana mutuloba uyo eti akakwiweti Emanuele, uku ekwambeti ‘Lesa uli nenjafwe’ ” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yosefe mpwalapunduka walensa ncalamwambila mungelo wa Mwami Lesa, walamumanta Maliya kuba mukashendi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nomba nikukabeco uliya kuya nendi kumalili sobwe mpaka panyuma pakutumbuka mwana mutuloba. Yosefe walamupa Lina eti Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Bensu balafumina kucishi ca kucwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu walasemenwa mu munshi wa Betelehemu mucimpansha ca Yudeya pacindi Helode mpwalikuba mwami mu cishico. Ku Yelusalemu kwalesa bantu baiya shakwenda kwa nyenyenshi balafumina kucishi ca kucwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mpobalashika ku Yelusalemu balikabepusheti “Inga mwana ngotwanyumfweti eshakabe Mwami wa Bayuda wasemenwa kupeyo? Afwe twalubona lunyenyenshi lwatuleshanga nkwabele kalupula kucwe, neco tulesa kumukambilila.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mwami Helode ne bantu bangi balikwikala mu Yelusalemu mpobalanyufweco, balapenga mumyoyo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Neco, Helode walabunganya mwabwangu bwangu, beshimilumbo bamakulene ne beshikwiyisha Milawo ya Mose ne kubepusheti, “Anu Mupulushi Walaiwa ne Lesa nakasemenwe kupeyo ayi?” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Balo balambeti, “Nakasemenwe mumunshi wa Betelehemu wa kucishi ca Yudeya, pakwinga tucinsheti Mabala a Lesa alambangeti,”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Obe Betelehemu wa mucishi ca Yudeya,</para>
  <para style="q">ntobe munshi ung'ana sobwe pakati pa minshi naimbi ya Bayuda.</para>
  <para style="q">Pakwinga mutangunishi</para>
  <para style="q">eshakembele Baisilayeli bantu ba Lesa</para>
  <para style="q">nakakafumine kuli njobe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mpwalanyumfweco Helode, walabakwila pambali bantu abo kwakubula bantu nabambi kwinshiba, ne kubepushisha cindi ncobalabona lunyenyenshi ulo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Neco Helode walabambileti, “Kamuyani ku Betelehemu mwenga mu mulangaule cenacena mwana uyo, mwakamucana, mukese kuno mukanjishibishe kumusena nkwabele, kwambeti nenjame nkenga kumukambilila.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Panyuma pakwambilwa maswi alico ne mwami, balanyamuka. Lunyenyenshi lusa ndobalabona kucwe, lwalabatangunina ne kuya kwimana mwilu pamusena palikuba mwanoyo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mpobalabona lunyenyenshi lusa balakondwa kwine. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Popelapo balengila mu ng'anda, balabona mwanoyo kali ne Maliya banyina, balasuntama ne kumukambilila. Balasungulula bifunta ne kupulisha bipo bya golide, lubani ne mafuta anunkila a mule ne kupa mwana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nomba Lesa walabacenjesha aba bantu bayiya kwenda kwa nyenyenshi muciloto kwambeti kabatabwelela kuli Helode. Neco mpobali kubwelela ku cishi cabo, balapitila nshila imbi.</para>
  <para style="s">Balafwambilinga ku Injipto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mpobalafumako, mungelo wa Mwami walabonekela kuli Yosefe muciloto, ne kumwambileti, “Nyamuka, manta mwana ne banyina, ufwambile ku Injipto, uye wikale kopeloko mpaka cindi ncoti nkakwambile, pakwinga Helode nalangaulenga mwana uyu kwambeti amushine.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Popelapo Yosefe walanyamuka mashiku ne kumanta mwana ne banyina kuya ku Injipto. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Walakekalako mpaka mpwalafwa Helode. Ici calenshika kwambeti ncalamba Mwami kupitila mumushinshimi cikwanilishiwe cakwambeti, “Ninkakuwe mwaname kufuma mu Injipto.”</para>
  <para style="s">Helode lashininga batwanike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Helode mpwaleshibeti, basa bantu baiya kwenda kwa nyenyenshi bamubona buluya walakalala, walatuma bantu ku Betelehemu, ne kuminshi yonse ya bambana, kwambeti benga bashine bana batuloba bonse kutatikila pali bakute byaka bibili kwisa panshi. Byaka ibi, balabelengela kufuma pacindi ncalanyumfwa kuli bantu basa baiya kwenda kwa nyenyenshi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mbyalamba mushinshimi Yelemiya byalakwanilishiwa bya kwambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Mibila ilanyumfwikinga mu Lama,</para>
  <para style="q">yakulila ne kompolola,</para>
  <para style="q">Lakelo, lalilinga banabendi,</para>
  <para style="q">lakananga kumumwenesha pacebo ca banabendi balafu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Balabwelenga kufuma ku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pacindi Helode usa mpwalafwa, mungelo wa Mwami walamubonekela Yosefe muciloto kali ku Injipto. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Walamwambileti, “Nyamuka, manta mwana ne banyina, ubwelele ku Islayeli, pakwinga bonse balikuyanda kushina mwana bafwa.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yosefe walapunduka ne kumanta mwana ne banyina ne kubwelela ku Islayeli. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nomba mpwalanyumfwa kwambeti, Alikelawo, mwanendi Helode, ewapyana baishi kuba mwami waku Yudeya, walatina kuyako. Neco kayi Lesa walamucenjesha Yosefe muciloto, walaya mucimpansha ca Galileya. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Balakekala mu munshi wa Nasaleti, kwambeti ncalamba mushinshimi cikwanilishiwe, cakwambeti, “Nakakwiweti, Munasaleti.”</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kukambauka kwa Yohane Mubatishi</para>
  <para style="s">(Maliko 1:1-8; Luka 3:1-18; Yohane 1:19-28)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mu masubayo walesa Yohane Mubatishi kakambauka mu cinyika caku Yudeya, <verse number="2" style="v"/>kambeti, “Shiyani bwipishi pakwinga Lesa ulipepi kwikalika Bwami bwakendi.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Uyu engwalikwamba Mushinshimi Yesaya mpwalambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Liswi lya muntu labilikishinga mucinyika kambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Bambani mukwakwa wa kupitamo Mwami,’</para>
  <para style="q">‘Lulamikani nshila njoti akapitemo.’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yohane walikufwala mwinjila wabweya bwa Ngamila, ne mukopo wacipaya mubukome. Cakulya cakendi calikuba bikobo ne bwiki bwamucisuwa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bantu balafumina mu Yelusalemu ne mu Yudeya kayi ne mubibela byonse bilipepi ne mulonga wa Yolodani, balikwisa kuli Yohane. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Abo balikulyambilila bwipishi bwabo, balabatishiwa mu mulonga wa Yolodani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yohane mpwalabona Bayuda bangi bamulikoto lya Bafalisi, ne Basaduki kabayanda kubatishiwa, nendi Yohane walabambileti, “Bana banjoka amwe, niyani sena walamucenjesheti mufwambe kutina bukalu bwa Lesa bulesanga? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Neco kamwinsani bintu bilaleshengeti mwashiya bwipishi bwenu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kamutalibepanga mu myoyo yenu kwambeti, ngamucifwamba cisubulo ca Lesa pakwambeti mushali wetu ni Abulahamu. Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti Lesa ingawasandula awa mabwe kuba banabendi Abulahamu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pacino cindi kembe kalibambila kutimbula citondo pamiyanda, neco citondo ciliconse cilabulunga kusema bisepo byaina, nibakacitimbule ne kuciwala mumulilo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Ame ndamubatishinga ne menshi kuba cilesho ca kushiya bwipishi bwenu, nomba panyuma pakame palesanga uyo eshakamubatishenga ne Mushimu Uswepa ne mulilo. Nendi wampita ngofu, cakwinseti nkandelela ne kunyamuna nkwabilo shakendi sobwe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Cakupupulushila cilikendi mu makasa akendi, kwambeti atatike kupupulusha. Nakabike maila apupulushiwa cena mu lyanga, nomba bungu nakabutente pamulilo utapu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu labatishiwanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliko 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pacindico, Yesu walesa kuli Yohane ku mulonga wa Yolodani, kufuma ku Galileya kwambeti Yohane enga mubatishe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yohane pakwelekesha kukana walambeti, “Nte njame ndelela kubatishiwa nenjamwe, nomba amwe kayi mulesanga kuli njame?” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Obe kosuminowa, pakwinga emotwelela kwinshila bintu byonse byabululami mbyalayandanga Lesa.” Neco Yohane walasumina.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalabatishiwa, walasabuka mu menshi. Popelapo kwilu kwalacaluka, walabona Mushimu wa Lesa kauseluka mbuli nkulimba nekwisa kwikala palyendiye, <verse number="17" style="v"/>kwilu kwalanyumfwika Liswi lyakwambeti, “Uyu e Mwaname ngondayandishisha, ndakondwa nendi.”</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kwelekeshewa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maliko 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Calakonkapo, Mushimu Uswepa walamutwala Yesu ku cinyika kuya kwelekeshewa ne Muyungaushi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwa masuba makumi ana, munshi ne mashiku,Yesu walikulikanisha kulya, neco walanyumfwa nsala. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Muyungaushi walesa kulyendiye walambeti, “Na njamwe Mwanendi Lesa, ambilani mabwe awa asanduke abe shinkwa.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walambeti, “Kwalembweti muntu nkelela kuba ne buyumi ne shinkwa enka sobwe, nsombi ne Maswi onse ngalambanga Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi, Muyungaushi walamutwala Yesu ku Yelusalemu, mushi waswepa, ne kumutantika pelu pa Ng'anda ya Lesa, <verse number="6" style="v"/>ne kumwambileti, “Na cakubinga njobe Mwanendi Lesa, kolilasha panshi, pakwinga kwalembweti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Lesa nambile bangelo bese bakubake</para>
  <para style="q">kwambeti, myendo yakobe</para>
  <para style="q">kaitapunta pamabwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walambeti, “Kwalembweti, ‘Kotamwelekeshanga Nkambo Lesa wakobe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pakupwililisha, Muyungaushi walamumanta Yesu ne kuya kumutantika pa mulundu utali, ne kumulesha bwendeleshi bonse bwa pacishi capanshi ne bulemu bwabo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Satana walambeti, “Byonse ibi nindikupe na usuntaminekowa, ne kunkambilila.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Apa lino Yesu walambeti, “Fumapa, Satana! Mabala alambangeti, ‘Welela kukambilila Nkambo Lesa wakobe, ne kumusebensela enka.’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Popelapo Muyungaushi walamushiya Yesu. Neco bangelo balesa kumunyamfwilisha Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu latatikinga incito yakendi mu Galileya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliko 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lino Yesu mpwalanyumfweti, Yohane lasungwa mu jele, walaya ku Galileya, <verse number="13" style="v"/>walaleka kwikala ku Nasaleti, walaya kwikala ku Kapelenawo, munshi walikuba mumbali mwa lwenje lwa Galileya, mucibela ca Sebuloni ne Nafitali. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ici calenshika, kukwanilisha calambwa kupitila mushinshimi Yesaya, uyo walambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Obe cimpansha ca Sebuloni, nenjobe cishi ca Nafitali,</para>
  <para style="q">kunshila yaku lwenje, patala pa Yolodani,</para>
  <para style="q">obe Galileya, cimpansha ca bantu babula kuba Bayuda!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bantu bekala mu mushinshe</para>
  <para style="q">ni bakabone mumuni unene.</para>
  <para style="q">Bantu bekala mucishi ca mufunsha wa lufu,</para>
  <para style="q">mumuni ulababonekele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kufuma cindi copeleco, Yesu walatatika kukambauka kambeti, “Shiyani bwipishi bwenu, pakwinga Lesa ulipepi kwikalika Bwami bwakendi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lakunga basulishi banswi bana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliko 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalikwenda mu mbali mwa lwenje lwa Galileya, walabona bantu babili pabukwabo, Shimoni walikukwiweti Petulo, ne Ndileya mukwabo, kabekata inswi mulwenje ne tombe twabo, pakwinga balikuba basulishi banswi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Nkonkeleni, ndimwiyishe kuba basulishi ba bantu.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Popelapo balashiya tombe twabo ne kuya nendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mpwalendako pang'ana walabona nabambi babili pabukwabo Jemusi ne Yohane, banabendi Sebedayo balikuba mu bwato pamo ne mushali wabo kababamba tombe twabo. Yesu walabakuwa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Popelapo balashiya bwato ne baishi nekuya neYesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu leyishinga bantu, kukambauka ne kusengula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu walendana mucimpansha conse ca Galileya, kaya kwiyisha mu manda akupaililamo ne kukambauka Mulumbe Waina ulambanga sha Bwami, nekusengula bantu balikukute malwashi apusana pusana ne bulema bwapusanapusana. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mpuwo yakendi yalamwaikila mucishi conse ca Siliya, cakwinseti bantu balikabaleta balwashi bonse balikupenga ne malwashi ne bishikubaba byapusana pusana, ne bekatwa ne mishimu yaipa ne balwashi atushita kayi ne balema. bonse walikubasengula. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Bantu bangi balikumukonkela kufuma ku Galileya, kucibela calikukwiweti Minshi Likumi, ne kuYelusalemu, neku Yudeya, kayi ne mucibela cakutala kwa mulonga wa Yolodani.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ciyisho capamulundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalabona likoto linene lya bantu balikumukonkela, walatanta pa mulundu ne kwikala panshi pamo ne beshikwiya bakendi, <verse number="2" style="v"/>walatatika kubeyisha kambeti,</para>
  <para style="s">Colwe ca ncine ncine</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Bakute colwe abo bacinka manungo pali Lesa, pakwinga Bwami bwa kwilu ni bwabo.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>bakute colwe, bantu balalilinga, pakwinga Lesa nakabaumbulushe.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>bakute colwe, bantu balicepesha, pakwinga nibakatambule ico Lesa ncalabalaya.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>bakute colwe, bantu balanyumfunga nsala ne nyotwa ya kwinsa cilayandanga Lesa, pakwinga nibakekutishiwe.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>bakute colwe bantu bakute nkumbo kubanabo, pakwinga Lesa nakabanyumfwile nkumbo.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>bakute colwe, bantu baswepa myoyo, pakwinga nibakabone Lesa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>bakute colwe bantu balaletenga lumuno, pakwinga nibakakwiweti bana ba Lesa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Bakute colwe bantu balapenshewanga,</para>
  <para style="q">pacebo cakwinsa calulama,</para>
  <para style="q">pakwinga Bwami bwa kwilu nibwabo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Mwalelekwa, omulatukanwanga, kupenshewa, ne kumubepesha bintu bingi bbyaipa pacebo cakwambeti munkonkelenga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kamusamwani, kayi kamukondwani, pakwinga cilambo cenu kwilu nicinene. Naboyo bashinshimi, amwe kamutana musemwa, balabapenshewa munshila yopeleyo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Makani a mucele ne mumuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maliko 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Amwe mulyeti mucele wa bantu bonse pacishi capanshi, nomba na mucele usambuluka, nicani celela kubweshulula mbuli ncowanga? Ulabulu ncito, nikutayowa pansa kaulyataulwa ne bantu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Amwe mulyeti mumuni wishikumunikila bantu bonse mucishi. Munshi webakwa pa mulundu nkawelela kubula kubonekela. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Paliya muntu ukute kubangilisha lampi nekwifwekelela munongo, nsombi bakute kubika pacakubikapo lampi, kwambeti umunikile bantu bonse bali mung'andomo, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Cimo cimo nenjamwe munikani pamenso abantu, kwambeti babona ncito shenu shaina, bakatembaule Bameshenu ba kwilu.</para>
  <para style="s">Makani a Milawo ya Mose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Kamutayeyeti ndesakupwisha Milawo ya Mose, ne biyisho bya bashinshimi. Ame ndiyakwisa kwipwisha sobwe, nsombi kwisa kwikwanilisha. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti kwilu necishi capanshi kabitanabipwa, paliya libala nilikaba ling'aneconi lya Mulawo lyeshi likafumemo, mpaka byonse bikakwanilishiwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Neco muntu labulunga kukonka mulawo umo uli mumilawo iyi, nambi kauli ung'aneconi, ne kwiyishako nabambi kwambeti naboyo babule kukonka, nakabe mung'ana mu Bwami bwa kwilu. Nomba muntu uliyense lakonkonga Milawo, ne kwiyishako nabambi kwambeti naboyo baikonke, nakabe mukulene mu Bwami bwa kwilu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Encondamwambililingeti, na bululami bwenu nkabwapita bululami bwa beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose ne Bafalisi, nteti mukengilemo mu Bwami bwa kwilu pimbi.</para>
  <para style="s">Makani abukalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luka 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mwalanyumfwa kwambeti, kaindi bantu balambilweti ‘Kotashina, uliyense lashini munendi welela komboloshewa ku nkuta.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nsombi lino ame ndamwambilingeti, muntu uliyense lakalalilinga mukwabo welela kupewa mulandu ku nkuta, Uliyense lambilinga munendi eti, ‘Omuluya’ Welela komboloshewa ku Nkuta. Nomba uliyense lambilinga munendi eti, ‘Cishilu’ Nendi welela kuyamu mulilo wa Gehena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Neco na ulesa necipo cakobe cakubenga kuli Lesa pa nteme, kayi wanuka kwambeti, munobe ukute mulandu nenjobe, <verse number="24" style="v"/>koshiya cipo cakobeco pambali pa nteme, koya unyumfwane mulumuno ne munobe, wenseco bwela ubenge cipo cakobe kuli Lesa panteme.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Kamufwambananga kunyumfwana ne muntu ngolepishili kamutana mushika ku nkuta. Kutineti ingaukutwala ku momboloshi, nendi momboloshi, ingaukubika mu makasa a mushilikali uyo welela kukuwala mu jele. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndakwambilishinga, nukekale mujele mpaka ukapwishe kulipila mwelo wamali a mulandu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Makani a bupombo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Mwalanyumfwa kwambeti kaindi bantu balambilweti, ‘Kotapombola.’ <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nomba lino ame ndamwambilingeti muntu uliyense lamulangishishinga mutukashi cakumukumbwa, lamupombolo kendi mumoyo wakendi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Na linso lyakobe lilakwipishinga, ulikolobolemo ulitaye. Caina kutayako lubasu lumo lwa mubili wakobe, kupita kuba ne mubili wakwana ne kuwalwa mu Gehena. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kayi na cikasa cakobe cakululyo cilakwipishinga, ucitimbule ucitaye. Caina kutayako lubasu lumo lwamubili wakobe, kupita kuba ne mubili wakwana ne kuwalwa mu Gehena.</para>
  <para style="s">Makani a kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mateyo 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maliko 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Kayi kaindi balambilweti, ‘Na muntu uleka mukashendi, amulembele ne kumupa cipepala cabushike.’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nomba ame lino ndamwambilingeti, uliyense lalekenga mukashendi pacebo cimbi cabula kuba cabupombo, uyo mukashi ebwa kumutuloba naumbi lenshi bupombo, nendi mutuloba uyo lamwebe ukute mulandu wabupombo.</para>
  <para style="s">Makani a kulumbila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Kayi mwalamfweti, kaindi bantu balambilweti, ‘Kotaumbila cabwepeshi, nsombi cinse ncowalalumbila kuli Lesa.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nomba ame ndamwambilingeti, lekani kulumbila sobwe. Kamutalumbilangeti, kwilu kwine nditu! pakwinga kwilu ekuli cipuna ca Mwami Lesa, <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kamutalumbilangeti, pacishi capanshi nditu! pakwinga pacishi capanshi epakulyata myendo yakendi Lesa. kayi kamutalumbilangeti ‘Pali Yelusalemu nditu!’ Pakwinga Yelusalemu ni munshi wa Mwami mukulene. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kamutalumbilangeti, ‘Mutwi wakame nditu,’ Pakwinga nkamwelela kusandula mishishi kuba ituba nambi ishipa. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kamwambangoweti, ‘Ee’ Nambi ‘ne.’ Cakusankanyapo pali ibi cilafumunga kuli Waipa usa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Makani a kubweshela caipa pa caipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mwalanyumfweti kaindi bantu balambilweti, Linso kubenga linso, lino kubenga lino. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nomba ame lino ndamwambilingeti “Kamutabweshelanga caipa kumuntu lamwipishili sobwe. Na muntu ukuma kulicili lya kululyo, akume kayi kulicili lya kucipiko. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Na muntu ukupa mulandu, ne kukukakatisheti umupe mwinjila wakobe, muleke amantile kumo ne munganjo. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Muntu uliyense amukakatisha kwenda nendi mushinso wakilomita imo, wende nendi mushinso wamakilomita abili. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Muntu amusenga cintu mupeni. Kayi muntu ayandanga kubweleka cintu kulinjobe kotamukanina.”</para>
  <para style="s">Makani a kusuna balwani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka 6:27-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mwalanyumfweti kaindi bantu balambilweti, Kosuna munobe, mupele mulwani wakobe. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nomba ame lino ndamwambilingeti, basuneni balwani benu ne kubapaililako kuli Lesa abo balamupenshenga. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mwenseco, emposhimubele limo bana ba Bameshenu balikwilu, bakute kuleta lumwi pa bantu baipa ne baina. Kayi bakute kulokela mfula pa bantu baina ne baipa. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Na kamusunakowa bantu bamusuni, ngamutambulapo cilambo cini kuli Lesa? Beshimisonko nabo nte ncobakute kwinsa copeleco? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kayi nakamupa mitende banse benu bonka, mulenshipo cani capita nabambi? Sena bantu batamwinshi Lesa nkabakute kwinsa copeleco? <verse number="48" style="v"/>Kamubani babula kampenda, mbuli Bameshenu bakwilu ncobabula kampenda.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Makani a nkumbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Kamutaliboneshanga kwinsa ncito shaina pamenso abantu kwambeti bamubone, mwenseco, nteti mukatambulepo cilambo kuli Bameshenu balikwilu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Neco mwapanga cintu ciliconse kumuntu laciyandanga, kamutaliboneshanga mbuli mobakute kwinshila bantu bandemishibili basa mumanda akupaililamo, ne munshila sha muminshi, balo bakute kwinseco kwambeti bantu bababone ne kubalumbaisha. Nditu ndamwambilishingeti abo balatambulililimo cilambo cabo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nomba obe wanyamfwanga bapenshi, munobe ngoli nendi pepi kabatenshiba sobwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wenseco, bipo byankumbo byakobe nukabinshibe wenka. Lino Baiso bakute kubona byasolekwa nibakakupe cilambo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Sha makani akupaila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mwapailanga kamutensanga mbuli bandemi shibili basa ncobakute kwinsa, balo bakute kuyanda kupaila kabali bemana mumanda akupaililamo, ne pamampambano anshila kwambeti bantu bababone. Cakubinga balo balatambulili limo cilambo <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba obe wayandanga kupaila, ingila mucimpetela, cala cisasa, upaile kuli Baiso bataboneke, Baiso bakute kubona byasolekwa nibakakupe cilambo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pacindi ncomulapailinga, kamutambanga maswi amo amo, mbuli ncobakute kwinsa bantu batamwinshi Lesa. Balo bakute kuyeyeti bafulishanga byakwamba empwelela kubanyumfwa Lesa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba amwe kamutabangeti endibo, pakwinga Bameshenu babinshi mbyomwabula, kamutana mubasenga. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi amwe pakupaila kamwambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">Bameshetu omuli kwilu,</para>
  <para style="q">lina lyenu lilemekwe,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Bwami bwenu bwise,</para>
  <para style="q">Kuyanda kwenu kwinshike.</para>
  <para style="q">Panshi pano mbuli ncekubele kwilu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mutupe lelo cakulya cetu ca masuba onse.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mutulekeleleko bwipishi bwetu,</para>
  <para style="q">mbuli nenjafwe ncotukute kubalekelelako bakute kutwipishila,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kamutasuminisha kwambeti tuwile mukweleshewa,</para>
  <para style="q">Nsombi tukwabilileni kuli Waipa usa.</para>
  <para style="p">“Pakwinga Bwami ne ngofu kayi ne bulemeneno ni bwenu kwamuyayaya. Ameni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maswi awa nkalipo mumipukutu yakaindi.</char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>Cakubinga na mulekelela bantu bwipishi bwabo, Bameshenu ba kwilu nabo nibakamulekelele. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nomba na nkamulekelele bantu bwipishi bwabo, nabo Bameshenu nteti bakamulekelele bwipishi bwenu sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Makani a kulikanisha kulya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Mwalikanishanga kulya, kamutabonekanga kungumana pamenso. mbuli ncobakute kwinsa bandemi shibili basa, balo bakute kwipisha pamenso kwambeti bantu bababoneti balikanishinga kulya. Cakubinga, balatambulililimo cilambo cabo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nomba obe walikanishanga kulya, samba kumenso, ne kusakula cena mishishi ku mutwi, <verse number="18" style="v"/>kwambeti bantu kabatenshibeti ulalikanishinga kulya, nsombi Baiso bataboneke ebelela kwinshiba bonka. Abo Baiso bakute kubona byasolekwa mbyolenshi nibakakupe cilambo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Buboni bwa kwilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Kamutalibunjikila buboni pacishi capanshi pano, apo mpobukute kubumbwa muswa, nambi kuba ne ndala, kayi nabo bakabwalala, mpobakute kwingila ne kwiba. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Neco kamubunganyani buboni bwenu kwilu, uko kwabula muswa nambi ndala, uko kabwalala nkwela kwalilwa kwingila ne kuyakwiba. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pakwinga kowabika buboni bwakobe, moyo wakobe ukute kauli kopeloko.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mumuni wa mubili ni menso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Menso elampi ya mubili na menso kalicena, mubili wakobe wonse ukute kauli wakwana kumunikilwa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nomba na menso akobe nkalipo cena, na mumuni mulinjobe usanduka kuba mushinshe. Lino akute aba citatiko ca mushinshe washipa mbii!”</para>
  <para style="s">Lesa ne Buboni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Muntu nkela kusebensela bantu babili pacindi cimo, pakwinga ngaupelapo umo, ne kusunako naumbi, nakashomeke kuli umo, ne kusampula naumbi. Nkamwelela kusebensela Lesa, ne buboni pacindi cimo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Ecebo cakendi ndamwambilingeti kamutayakamwanga ne buyumi bwenu, kwambeti nitukalye cani, nambi nitukanwe cani? Nambi nitukafwale cani, sena buyumi bwenu nkabwapita cakulya? Nambi mubili nkawapita byakufwala? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kamubonani bikeni, nkabikute kubyala mbuto, nambi kutebula ne kubika mulyanga sobwe, nomba Bameshenu bakwilu bakute kubilyesha. Sena amwe nkamwayandika kupita bikeni? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Niyani mulinjamwe wayakamwa ne buyumi, wela kucikonsha kunungako busuba bumowa ku buyumi bwakendi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Inga mukute kushilacani mano ku byakufwala? Bonani maluba amucisuwa mwakute kukulila, nkakute kusebensa, nambi kulyanina bikwisa sobwe. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nomba ndamwambilinga mwami Solomoni, nambi walikuba mubile, uliyawa kufwalapo byakufwala byabekema mbuli maluba. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lino na Lesa kacikonsha kufwalika mila yamucisuwa, iyo ikute kubakowa lelo, lilo nikwitenta mulilo, Lesa ngaubula kumufwalika sena akaka! Mobalushomo lung'anamwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Ecebo cakendi kamutayakamwanga ne kwambeti, ‘Inga lelo nindicicane kupeyo cakulya’ Nambi ‘cakunwa’ Nambi ‘cakufwala? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ibi nibintu mbyobakute kuyakamwa bantu batamwinshi Lesa. Amwe Bameshenu ba kwilu bacinshi kwambeti nenjamwe mulabiyandanga bintu ibi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nomba amwe nanshi mulangaule Bwami bwa Lesa, ne bululami bwakendi, nabimbi ibi Lesa nakamubikilepo. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Neco nkabayakamwa ne byalilo, byalilo nibyalilo. Busuba bulibonse bukute makatasho abo.”</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Makani a kombolosha munobe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luka 6:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Kamutomboloshanga banenu, kwambeti nenjamwe Lesa akabule kumombolosha. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Momukute komboloshela banenu, mopelomo nenjamwe Lesa mweti akamomboloshele. Kayi mwelo ngomukute kusebenshesha pakombolosha, mwelo wopelowo nukasebensheshewe pali njamwe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mukute kuboneconi kantu kang'ana kali mulinso mwamunobe, kotayeye omwine cishiki cili mulinso lyakobe? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ngaumwambileconi munobeti, ‘Tubone ndikufunye kantu mulinso,’ Kakuli obe mulinso mwakobe muli cishiki? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Obe wandemi shibili! nanshi tatika kufunya cishiki ico cili mu linso lyakobe, empowelela kubona cena ne kukafunyamo kantu kali mulinso lyamunobe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Kamutapa bakabwa bintu bya Lesa, pakwinga ingabamubwelela ne kwisa kumuluma. Nambi kuwalila nkumba mikanda yamalungu, pakwinga nishikalwataulowa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Sengani,langaulani kayi konkoshani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Senga nakamupe, langaula nimukacane, kukonkosha nibakamucalwile cisasa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ee, muntu lasengenga winga kupewa, muntu lalangaulunga winga kucicana, kayi muntu lakonkoshonga bakute kumucalwila cisasa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Niyani pakati penu amwe bamashali welela kupa libwe mwanendi lasenge shinkwa? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nambi usenga lunswi, ngamumupa njoka sena? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lino amwe ne kwipa kwenuku, mucinshi kupa banabenu bintu byaina, kulyeconi kuli Bameshenu bakwilu, sena ngabalilwa kupa bintu byaina kuli balamusengenga?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Neco, mubintu bili byonse mbyomulayandangeti bantu bamwinshile, mwelela nanshi amwe kubenshila byopelebyo. Pakwinga uku ekukwanilisha milawo ya Mose, ne biyisho bya bashinshimi.</para>
  <para style="s">Cishinga cing'ana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kamwingililani mwakulipakatisha pacishinga cing'ana. Pakwinga cishinga cilatwalanga ku lufu ni cinene, ne nshila yatandabala ne bantu balapitingamonga nibagi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nomba cishinga cakuya kwingila kubuyumi nica kulipakatisha, ne nshila yakendi yayuma kwendamo, nabo balendengamonga nibang'ana.</para>
  <para style="s">Citondo ne bisepo byakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luka 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kamucenjelani ne bashinshimi bandemi shibili. Bakute besanga kulinjamwe kababoneka babomba myoyo eti mbelele. Nomba mukati balyeti baumpe bansala. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nimukabeshibile ku bisepo byabo. Sena bitondo bya myunga ngabisema minyansa? Sena ingamucana nkuyu ku kankolong'onso? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Citondo caina cikute kusema bisepo byaina, nomba citondo caipa cikute kusema bisepo byaipa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Citondo caina nkacelela kusema bisepo byaipa sobwe, nambi citondo caipa kusema bisepo byaina nkacinshiki pimbi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Citondo ciliconse citaseme bisepo byaina bakute kucitimbula ne kuciwala pa mulilo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Neco, bantu nimukabeshibile kuncito shabo.</para>
  <para style="s">Busuba bwa lombolosho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Nteye muntu lambangoweti, ‘Nkambo, Nkambo,’ Eti akengile mu Bwami bwa kwilu sobwe, nsombi uyo lenshinga ncobalayandanga Bata ba kwilu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pabusuba bwakomboloshewa bantu bangi nibakambengeti, ‘Nkambo, Nkambo!’ Sena afwe ntetwali kukambauka mu lina lyenu? Twalikucikonsha kupulisha mishimu yaipa pakusebenshesha lina lyenu, mu lina lyenu kayi twalikwinsa bishikukankamanisha. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nomba ame ninkabambile pamensotuba kwambeti, ‘nkandimwishipo sobwe, fumani apa!’ Mobeshi kwinsa byaipa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Beshikwibaka ng'anda babili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Uliyense lanyumfunga ne kwakonkela maswi akame, welana ndendende ne muntu wamano uyo walebaka ng'anda yakendi palibwe lyacandanshi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwalaloka mfula, milonga yalesula, lukupwe lwangofu lwalauma kung'anda, nomba ng'anda iliya kuwa sobwe, pakwinga walaibaka palibwe lyacandanshi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Nomba uliyense lanyumfunga maswi akame, nsombi kabula kwakonkela, welana ndendende, ne muntu wapunama uyo walebaka ng'anda yakendi pa museya. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kwalaloka mfula, milonga yalesula, lukupwe lwangofu lwalauma kung'anda, ng'anda yalawa, nomba kuwa kwa ng'andeyo kwalikuba kunene kuyosha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Injiyishilo ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalapwisha kwamba makani awa, bantu bangi balakankamana ne njiyishilo yakendi. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pakwinga nkalikubeti beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose, nsombi nendi walikwiyisha ne ngofu.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga shimankuntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maliko 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalaseluka pa mulundu pasa, bantu bangi balamukonkela. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lino muntu walikukute bulwashi bwa mankuntu, walesakusuntama ne kwambeti, “Nkambo, nakamuyanda ngamunswepesha” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu walatandabula cikasa cakendi ne kumukumya, ne kwambeti, “Ee, ndayandanga, ‘Swepa!’ Popelapo walabacena.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kufumapo Yesu walamwambileti, “Nyumfwa, kotambilako nabambi sobwe, obe koya uliboneshe kuli shimilumbo, utwale mulumbo usa ngwalamba Mose, kwambeti bantu baboneti ulaba cena.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mushilikali Mukulene Waciloma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mpwalashika Yesu mu munshi wa Kapelenawo, mushilikali mukulene wabashilikali mwanda, walesa kusenga lunyamfwo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Walasengeti, “Nkambo, musebenshi wakame wona kung'anda nimulwashi, nkelela kucikonsha kwenda, lakolwanga.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Ndesanga kumusengula.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba mushilikali usa walambeti, “Sobwe Nkambo, ame nkandelela kwambeti amwe mwenga kuyakwingila mung'anda yakame, kamwambani maswi onka, musebenshi wakame nabe cena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Pali bamakulene mbonkute kunyumfwila, nomba nenjame nkute bashilikali bakute kunyumfwila. Na ndambili mushilikali, ‘Koya’ Cakubinga ukute kuya. Na ndambili naumbi eti ‘Kwesa kuno’ Cakubinga ukute kwisa, na ndambili musha wakameti, ‘kwensa ici cakubinga ukute kucinsa.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lino Yesu mpwalanyumfweco walakankamana, walambila bantu basa balikumukonkeleti, “Kwamba cakubinga, nambi pakati pa Baislayeli paliya kucanikapo lushomo lulicisa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti bantu bangi nibakafumine kucwe, ne kumbonshi, kwisakwikala pamo ne Abulahamu ne Isake kayi ne Yakobo pa malyalya amu Bwami bwakwilu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nomba abo banga belela kuba mu Bwami ubo, nibakataiwe kunsa mumushinshe. Kopeloko nibakalile ne kukokota meno abo, cebo cakubabwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Popelapo Yesu walambila mukulene wabashilikali, “Kamuyani kung'anda, cinshike kwelana ne lushomo ndokute.” Pacindi copeleco musebenshi wakendi walaba cena.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga bantu bangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maliko 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalengila mu ng'anda ya Petulo, walabona kumakwendi batukashi kabali bona, kabakolwa cimpwita. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Walabekata kucikasa popelapo cimpwita calapwa. Kumakwendi Petulo balapunduka, ne kutatika kubambila Yesu cakulya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mansailo, pabusuba bopelobo, bantu balaleta balwashi bangi bekatwa ne mishimu yaipa, Yesu walikupulisha mishimu ne maswi onka, kayi balwashi bonse walikubasengula. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Byonsebi walabinsa kwambeti, mbyalamba mushinshimi Yesaya bikwanilishiwe, byakwambeti, “Nendi walamanta bishikubaba ne malwashi etu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Makani a kukonkela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalabona likoto lyabantu balikuba bamushinguluka, walambila beshikwiya bakendi, “Katutampukilani kutala kwa lwenje kusa.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nomba pacindi copeleco palashika umo wabeshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose walambila Yesu eti, “Bashikwiyisha, ame ndayandanga kuba shikwiya wenu kayi nindimukonkelenga kulikonse nkomulenga.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Bamwaba bakute bilingo, nabyo bikeni bikute bisangala byakwikalamo. Nomba ame nde Mwana Muntu ndiya musena wakona nepumwininapo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nomba shikwiya naumbi walambila Yesu, eti, “Nkambo, nsuminisheni mbwelele nanshi embike bata.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Neye Yesu walamwambileti, “Obe nkonkele. Kobaleka bafwa babikenga bantu babo bafwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalekeshenga lukupwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliko 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu pamo ne beshikwiya bakendi balatanta bwato nekuya. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mwacimfundumukila kwalesa lukupwe luyosha pa lwenje, mankape alatatika kwingila mu bwatomo, nomba Yesu walikali wonatulo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kacili wona, beshikwiya balayakumunyukumuna ne kwambeti, “Nkambo, tupulusheni, tulipepi kufwa!” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Mulatininga cani amwe mobantu mukute lushomo lung'ana?” Mpwalambeco walemana ne kulucancilila lukupwe ne mankape, popelapo pa lwenje palamwena tonto. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Beshikwiya basa balakankamana ne kwambeti, “Inga uyu ni muntu ulyeconi cakwinseti lukupwe ne mankape byonse bilamunyumfwilinga?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga bantu bekatwa ne mishimu yaipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliko 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalashika kutala kwa lwenje, mu cibela ca Gadala, walakumanya bantu babili bekatwa ne mishimu yaipa kabafuma kunamaumbwe. Balikuba bakalu, cakwinseti paliya muntu naba umo walikupita nshila iyo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco balatatika kolobesheti, “Mulayandanga cani amwe Mwanendi Lesa? Sena mulesa kuno kwisa kutupensha cindi kacitanacishika?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nomba palikuba litanga linene lya nkumba shalikulya pepi napo mpobalikuba. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mishimu yaipa yalamupapatila Yesu, ne kwambeti, “Mwatupulisha, mutusuminishe twenga kwingila mulitanga lya nkumba shisa shilipasa.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu walayambileti, “Ee, kamuyani,” Nayo yalapula ne kuya kwingila munkumba shisa. Popelapo likoto lya nkumba lyalafwambalubilo kuselemukila kumukolo kwa mulundu ne kuyakuwila mulwenje, moshalakafwila shonse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Abo balikwembela nkumba balafwamba, balashika kumunshi, nekwambila bantu bintu byonse byalenshika kubantu basa babili balikuba bekatwa ne mishimu yaipa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Popelapo bantu bonse mumunshi balapula kuya kukumana ne Yesu. mpobalamucana balamusenga kwambeti afume mucibela ico.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga muntu watontola bilama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliko 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu walatanta mu bwato ne kutampuka lwenje, kuya kumunshi nkwalikwikala. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kopeloko bantu nabambi balamuletela mulema watontola myendo kabali bamoneka pampasa. pakubona lushomo lwabo, Yesu walambila mulema uyo “Yumisha moyo omwanobe! bwipishi bwakobe bulalekelelwa.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mpwalenseco beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose nabambi, balatatika kumufwiya mumyoyo yabo ne kwambeti, “Uyu muntu lanyanshanga Lesa!” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu pakwishiba miyeyo yabo walambeti, “Mukute kuyeyela cani bintu byaipa mumyoyo yenu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Capubako nicipeyo kwambeti, ‘Bwipishi bwakobe bulalekelelwa’ Nambi kwambeti, ‘nyamuka wende.’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba ndayandanga kwambeti mwinshibeti, Mwana Muntu ukute ngofu shakulekelela bwipishi pacishi capanshi pano.” Neco walambila mulema watontola myenda uyu, “Nyamuka manta mpasa yakobe, koya kwenu.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Popelapo muntu usa walanyamuka ne kuya kumunshi kwabo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bantu basa mpobalaboneco, balekatwa buyowa, ne kulumbanya Lesa walapa bantu ngofu shabwendeleshi shilicisa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lakunga Mateyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliko 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalikufumako walabona muntu walikukwiweti, Mateyo kaliwekala mukanda ka misonko, walamwambileti, “Nenjobe, nkonke.” Pacindi copeleco Mateyo walanyamuka ne kumukonkela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalikulya mu ng'anda ya Mateyo. Kwalesa beshimisonko bangi, ne beshi kwinsa byaipa, balesa kulya nendi pamo ne beshikwiya bakendi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mpobalaboneco Bafalisi, balatatika kubepusha beshikwiya bakendi Yesu eti, “Inga bashikwiyisha benu balalingeconi pamo ne beshimisonko, ne beshi kwinsa byaipa?” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu pakunyumfweco, walabakumbuleti, “Bantu balabulunga kukolwa nkabakute kuyanda mu ng'anga sobwe, nsombi balwashi ebakute kuyanda mung'anda.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Nomba kamwiyani cilambanga maswi awa, alambangeti, ‘Nkandayandangeti bantu bampe milumbo sobwe, nsombi ndayandangeti bantu beenshilenga nkumbo kubanabo.’ Pakwinga nkandaleshila kukuwa bantu balulama sobwe, nsombi beshikwinsa byaipa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Makani akulikanisha kulya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maliko 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi beshikwiya ba Yohane mubatishi, balesa kuli Yesu ne kumwipusheti, “Afwe, ne Bafalisi tukute kulikanisha kulya tunkanda twingi, nomba nicani beshikwiya benu nkabakute kulikanishapo?” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walambeti, “Sena banendi shibwinga ngabalyetesha bacibanga pamo ne shibwinga? Ico nkacinshiki sobwe! Nomba nicikashike cindi ncotibakamufulepo shibwinga usa, popelapo nibakatatike kulikanisha kulya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Muntu nkakute kumamika cikamba ca cikwisa ca lino lino ne kucitungila pa mwinjila ukulukulu, pakwinga cikamba ca cikwisa ca lino lino ngacikokonyana nekumatula uwo mwinjila ukulukulu, ne kumatuka kulico kukute kushiya cibwanko. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kayi paliya muntu ukute kubika waini mucifwafumwa cacipaya cakaindi sobwe, pakwinga nawinseco, cifwafumwa cacipaya ngacipasuka, waini ngautaika, nasho nkomwa ngashibula ncito. Waini walino lino bakute kubika munkomwa sha lino lino. Neco byonse bibili bikute kubambwa cena.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga mwanendi Yailo ne mutukashi naumbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maliko 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu kacamba, kwalesa mukulene wa Bayuda walesa kumusuntamina ne kwambeti, “Mwaname mutukashi ulipepi kufwa, ndapapata kamwisani mubike makasa enu palyendiye, kwambeti abe muyumi.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Popelapo Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi balanyamuka ne kuya nendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lino palikuba mutukashi walikukolwa bulwashi bwa mukunko kwa byaka likumi ne bibili, walesa cakunyuma kwa Yesu, ne kwisa kwikata kucelele kwa munganjo wa Yesu, <verse number="21" style="v"/>mumoyo mwakendi walikayeyeti, “Na njikatekowa munganjo wakendi ni nsengulwe.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu popelapo walacebuka ne kumubona mutukashi uyo, Yesu walambeti, “Yumisha moyo mwaname, lushomo lwakobe lulakupulushu.” Pacindi copeleco mutukashi usa walasengulwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalashika ku ng'anda kwa mukulene wa Bayuda usa, walacana bantu kabalilisha mikonkobesho nebisekele, nabambi kabalyuma pacali kulila mibila. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lino nendi Yesu walabambileti, “Kamupulani mwense, kashimbi uyu uliya kufwa sobwe, nsombi wonowatulo.” Popelapo bangi balatatika kumuseka. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nomba bonse mpobalapulamo mu ng'anda,Yesu walaya kucimpetela nkwalikuba ne kuyakwikata kashimbi uyu pacikasa, popelapo walapunduka. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Impuwo iyi yalanyumfwika mucibela ca cishico.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga bantu babili bashipilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mpwalikufumako, bantu bashipilwa babili balamukonkela nekutatika kubilikisheti, “Amwe Yesu mwanendi Dafeti, tunyumfwilekoni nkumbo!” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalengila mung'anda bashipilwa babili basa balesa kulyendiye. nendi walabepusheti, “Sena mwashometi ngandimusengula?” Naboyo balakumbuleti, “Ee twashoma Nkambo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu walabekata mumenso, ne kwambeti, “Cinshike kwelana ne lushomo lwenu.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Popelapo menso abo alacaluka, balacikonsha kubona. Nomba Yesu walabambilisheti kabataya bambileko muntu naba umo sobwe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nomba kufumapo balo balatatika kumwaya mpuwo kumuntu uliyense mucibela ico.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga cibulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mpobalapula mung'anda nekutatika kuya, bantu nabambi balaleta muntu walikuba cibulu, cebo cakwikatwa ne mushimu waipa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalaufunya mushimu waipa usa, muntusa walacikonsha kwamba. Nomba bantu balakankamana cakwinseti balatatika kwambeti, “Nkatuna tucibonapo cintu camushoboyu mu Islayeli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nomba nabo Bafalisi balambeti, “Lamupanga ngofu shakufunya mishimu yaipa ni mukulene wa mishimu yaipa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Basebenshi beshikutebula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu walendana mu minshi inene, ne ing'ana ing'ana, walikwiyisha mu misena yabo yakupaililamo, ne kukambauka Mulumbe Waina wa Bwami bwa Lesa, Kayi walasengula bulema bwapusanapusana ne malwashi apusana pusana. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalabona makoto a bantu, walanyumfwa luse, pakwinga balikuba bantu balemenwa kayi batyompwa kubeti mbelele shabula mwembeshi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu walambila beshikwiya bakendi eti, “Butebushi bulafulu, nomba basebenshi balacepe. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Neco, kamusengani Lesa mwine butebushi kwambeti atume basebenshi bangi kuya kutebula.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasalanga batumwa likumi ne babili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliko 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu walakuwa beshikwiya bakendi likumi ne babili, walabapa ngofu sha kupulisha mishimu yaipa, kayi ne ngofu shakusengula bulema apusanapusana ne malwashi apusanapusana. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Maina abatumwa basa likumi ne babili, ni Shimoni, walikukwiweti, Petulo ne Ndileya mukwabo, ne Jemusi mwanendi Sebedayo, ne Yohane mukwabo, <verse number="3" style="v"/>ne Filipo, ne Batolomeyo, ne Tomasi ne Mateyo, walikusonkesha misonko, ne Jemusi mwanendi Alufeyo, ne Tadeyo, <verse number="4" style="v"/>ne Shimoni wa mucipani ca bantu balikulwanina lwanguluko mu cishi ca Islayeli, kayi ne Yuda Sikalyote, uyo walamulisha Yesu kubalwani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu latumunga likumi ne babili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Aba bantu bali likumi ne babili, Yesu walabatuma ne kubapa malailile akwambeti, “Kamutaya kubantu babula kuba Bayuda sobwe, nambi kuya kwingila mu munshi uliwonse wa bene Samaliya sobwe. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba amwe kamuyani kuli Baislayeli abo balyeti mbelele shataika. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kamuyani, mukambaukengeti, Lesa ulipepi kwikalika bwami bwakendi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Sengulani balwashi, kupundusha bafwa, kusengula mankuntu, ne kupulisha mishimu yaipa. Mulatambulu kwabulyo, ne njamwe kamupani kwabulyo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kamutamanta mali mumpotomona shenu, golide nambi silifa, nambi mali amukuba. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kamutamanta cipokolo ca pabulwendo, nambi kumanta minjila ibili, nambi nkwabilo, nambi nkoli. Basebenshi bela kutambula bintu mbyobabula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Mwengila mu munshi uliwonse, mulangaule muntu layandishishinga kumutambula, amutambula ikalani ku ng'anda kopeloko mpaka cishika cindi cakufumamo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pakwingila mu ng'anda mwambengeti, ‘lumuno lube ne njamwe.’ <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lino bamutambula calushinisho bene ng'anda, lumuno lwenu lube nabo nditu, nomba na bene ng'anda balakana kumutambula, lumuno lwenu lubwelele kulinjamwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Muntu uliyense akana kumutambula, nambi kunyumfwa maswi ngomukute, pampamunani lusuko lwakumyendo kwenu mwafumanga mung'andomo nambi mumunshi umo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, pabusuba bwalombolosho, nicikabeko capuba kubantu baku Sodomu, ne Gomola, kupita bantu ba mumunshi uwo.</para>
  <para style="s">Batumwa nibakapenshewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maliko 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Kamunyumfwani! Ndamutumunga mbuli mbelele pakati pa baumpe, neco kamubani bacenjela mbuli njoka, nomba kayi babomba myoyo mbuli nkulimba. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mucenjele nabo bantu, pakwinga nibakamwikate ne bakamutwale kunkuta, ne kumukwapula bikoti mu manda abo akupaililamo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nibakamutwale ku bamanduna, ne kubami, pacebo canjame, cakwinseti ni mukambeleko bakamboni pamenso pabo, ne pamenso abantu bamishobo naimbi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bakamutwalanga ku nkuta, kamutaka yakamwanga kwambeti, ‘Inga ne twambeconi’ Nambi nitwambe cani. Pacindi copeleco ni mukapewe maswi akwamba. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pakwinga ntamwe mweshi mukambenga sobwe, nsombi shikwamba ni Mushimu Uswepa wa Lesa Bameshenu, eti ukambenga kupitila muli njamwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Mukwabo nakabukile mukwabo nekumushinisha, baishi nibakabukile mwana nekumushinisha, nabo bana nibakabukile bamashali babo, ne kubashinisha. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bantu bonse ni bakapelane ne njamwe pacebo cakame. Nomba uyo eshakemanowa ncili mukunshoma mpaka kumapwililisho, endiyeti akapuluke. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lino bakatatika kumupensha mu munshi uwu ne uwo, mukafwambile ku minshi naimbi. Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, kamutana mupwisha kwendela minshi yonse ya Baislayeli, Mwana Muntu nakabenga kaliwesa kendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Shikwiya nkapita lamwiyishinga sobwe, kayi musebenshi nkapita muntu walamwingisha ncito sobwe. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ee, ngacibeco kwambeti, shikwiya ngawelana ne lamwiyishinga, kayi musebenshi ngawelana ne walamwingisha ncito. Nomba lino na mwine mukowa, bantu balamupa lina eti, Belesebulu, Inga bantu bamukowa wakendi sena nkabelela kubapa maina aipa apitapo?”</para>
  <para style="s">Welela kutinwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Neco, kamutatinanga bantu, kantu kalikonse kafwekelelwa nikakafwekulwe, kayi kalikonse kasolekwa nikakeshibikwe. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mbyondamwambilinga mu mushinshe, amwe mukabyambilenga patuba, ibyo mbyomulanyumfwili kumukushi, amwe mukabyambilenga pelu paciluli. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kamutatinanga abo bakute kushina mubili, pakwinga nkabela kushina mushimu. Nsombi amwe kamutinani uyo wela kononga byonse bibili, mubili ne mushimu pamo, mu Gehena. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Sena tutite tubili nkatukute kulwa ne kalyali kamo? Nsombi paliya nakakaba kamo kakute kulaka panshi kwakubula Bameshenu kwinshiba. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nomba kulinjamwe, ne mishishi ya mu mutwi yonse yabelengewa ne Lesa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Neco kamutatina, amwe mwapita mwelo wa tutite twingi!</para>
  <para style="s">Kusuminisha pa menso abantu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Abo bakute kunsumina pamenso abantu kwambeti nibakame, nenjame ninkabasumine pamenso a Bata balikwilu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nomba lankananga pamenso abantu, nenjame ninkamukane pamenso a Bata bakwilu kwambeti nkandimwishipo sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kupansana kwa bantu pacebo ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Sena mulayeyengeti ndaleshila lumuno pacishi capanshi? Ame ndiya kwishila lumuno sobwe, nsombi censho ca nkondo. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ndalesa kupansanya mwana mutuloba ne baishi, mwana mutukashi ne banyina, mulekashi ne banyina shala, <verse number="36" style="v"/>balwani ba muntu nibakabe bansebendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Muntu wasunisha baishi ne banyina kupita ame, nkelela kuba shikwiya wakame sobwe. Kayi uyo wasunisha mwana mutuloba nambi mwana mutukashi kupita ame neye nkelela kuba shikwiya wakame. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Alikane mwine, kayi alibambile kupeshewa, ne kufwa cebo ca kunkonkela. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Uliyense layandanga kupulusha buyumi bwakendi, nakabutaye, nsombi uyo latayanga buyumi bwakendi pacebo cakame, nakabucane nditu!</para>
  <para style="s">Kutambula cilambo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maliko 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Muntu lamutambulunga, latambulungame, nendi lantambulunga, latambulunga uyo walantuma. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Muntu latambulunga mushinshimi, pacebo cakwambeti ni mushinshimi, nakatambule cilambo ca mushinshimi. Latambulunga muntu walulama, pacebo cakwambeti walulama, nakatambule cilambo ca muntu walulama. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Uliyense lapanga menshi atontola mu nkomeshi, kuli umo wa beshikwiya bakame, pacebo cakwambeti ni shikwiya wakame, cakubinga ndamwambilingeti, nendi nteti akalilwe kutambula cilambo camwelela.”</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yohane mubatishi latumunga batumwa bakendi kuli Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalapwisha kubapa busele beshikwiya bakendi likumi ne babili, walafumako nekuya kwiyisha, ne kukambauka mu minshi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mbyalikwinsa Klistu, byalanyumfwika kuli Yohane mubatishi kali mujele, neco walatuma beshikwiya bakendi kulyendiye. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kuya kumwipusheti, “Sena njamwe ngobalikwambeti lakesanga, mpani tupembele naumbi?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Kamuyani mumwambile Yohane, bintu mbyomulanyumfunga, ne kubibona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bashipilwa balabononga, nabo balema miyendo balendenga, bashimankuntu balasengulwanga, bashinka matwi balatatiki kunyumfwa, bafwa balapundukunga, nawo Mulumbe Waina ulakambaukwanga kubapenshi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Walelekwa muntu labulunga kutonshanya shanjame.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pacindi beshikwiya ba Yohane basa mpobalafumako, Yesu walatatika kwamba sha Yohane, ne kwipusha makoto abantu eti, “Mpomwalikuya kucinyika, mwalayakubona cani? Sena lyalikuba litete lyalikutenkana ne lukupwe? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mwalayakubona cani? Sena ni muntu wafwala byakufwala bya mulo wadula? Bantu bakute kufwala byakufwala bya mulo wadula bakute kwikala mu manda a bami! <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kamung'ambilani, mwalayakubona cani? Sena walikuba mushinshimi? Ee, nicakubinga, nomba ndamwambilishingeti, mwalabona wapita mushinshimi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Uyu endiye usa Mabala a Lesa ngalikwambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mutumwa wakame uyu,</para>
  <para style="q">ndamutumunga pantangu pakobe,</para>
  <para style="q">kwambeti abambile limo nshila njoti ukeshilemo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndamwambilingeti, mubantu bonse balasemwa kubatukashi, paliya naba umo munene wapita Yohane Mubatishi, nomba nendi uyo mung'ana mu Bwami bwakwilu wamupita Yohane. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kufuma pacindi ca Yohane mubatishi mpaka lelo, Bwami bakwilu bwakwabililwa mwangofu ne bantu balayandangowa kubulumina banabo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mu milawo ya Mose, ne bashinshimi balikabamba sha Bwami bopelobu, mpaka kushika kucindi ca Yohane mubatishi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na mulayandanga kushoma, ishibani kwambeti, Yohane endiye Eliya walikwambweti lakesanga, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Uyo ukute matwi, kanyumfwani!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Anu bantu bamusemanowu ngandibelenkanya necani? Balyeti batwanike balatotekeshananga pamusena wa makwebo, bambi kabepusha banabo eti,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Twalamombela ngoma,</para>
  <para style="q">nomba mwalabulila cani kushana?</para>
  <para style="q">Twalembila nyimbo sha malila,</para>
  <para style="q">nomba nicani amwe muliya kulilako sobwe?”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Yohane mubatishi mpwalesa, kalikanisha byakulya, ne byakunwa, mwali kamwambeti, wekatwa ne mushimu waipa!” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mwana Muntu nendi walikulya nekunwa, uliyense walatatika kwambeti, “Kamubonani muntuyu nicakolwa, kayi nimukuma, wasunana ne beshimisonko ne bantu babwipishi, nomba Mano akendi alabonekenga mubyakwinsa byakendi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Minshi yabula lushomo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi Yesu walatatika kushingana minshi njalenshilamo bintu bingi byangofu, pakwinga bantu mu minshiyo baliya kushinta myoyo yabo sobwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Walambeti, “Malele obe Kolasini! Malele obe Betisaida! Pakwinga bintu byangofu byalenshika kulinjamwe, anu nibyalenshikila ku Tulo ne Sidoni, nshinga bantu bakendi ne balafwala masankunya, ne kulitila milota, kubonesha kushinta myoyo kwabo, <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nomba ndamwambilingeti, pabusuba bwa lombolosho, nicikabeko capuba kunyumfwilako luse Tulo ne Sidoni, kupita amwe. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nenjobe Kapelenawo, sena ulayeyengeti nakakutantike kwilu? Wangwela! Nakakulashe panshi mpaka ku musena wa bantu bafwa, pakwinga bintu bya ngofu byalenshika kulinjobe, ne byalenshikila mu Sodomu, nshinga Sodomu nacilipo nelelo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nomba ndamwambilingeti, pabusuba bwalombolosho nicikabe capubako kunyumfwilako luse bene Sodomu kupita amwe!”</para>
  <para style="s">Kamwisani kulinjame mupumwine</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco Yesu walambeti, “Amwe Ta, mobene kwilu ne cishi capanshi, ndamulumbu pakuyubulula bintu ibi kubatwanike, ne kubisoleka kubantu bamano akucishi, <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ee, Ta, kwinamoyo kwenu mwalayanda kwinseco.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Ta mwalampa bintu byose mumakasa akame, paliya nabaumo wela kumwinshiba cena Mwana, nsombi Baishi bonka ebala kumwinshiba cena, kayi paliya nabaumo wela kwinshiba cena babula kuba Baishi, nsombi Mwana ewinshi cena Baishi, neye ukute kuyubulwila abo mbwalayandanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Kamwisani kulinjame amwe omwalema cebo ca kunyamuna mitolo, kwambeti mucane kupumwina. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kamumantani lijoko lyakame, kayi mwiye kulinjame.Pakwinga ndabomba moyo kayi ndalicepesha, kayi nimwise mucane kupumwina. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lijoko lyakame lyapuba, ne mutolo wakame wapuba.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="11:30">Basune babili basungwa lijoko balaliminga mulibala</figure></para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Busuba bwa Sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maliko 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pabusuba bwa Sabata, bwakupumwina kwa Bayuda, Yesu walikapita mu libala lya maila pamo ne beshikwiya, beshikwiya bakendi balanyumfwa nsala, neco balatatika kuningula ngala sha maila ne kushilya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mpobalaboneco Bafalisi, Yesu balamwambileti, “Kamubonani ncobalenshinga beshikwiya benu pabusuba bwa Sabata cabula kusuminishiwa ne Mulawo” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nendi walabambileti, “Sena muliya kubelengapo ncalensa Dafeti, mpwalanyumfwa nsala pamo ne banendi mbwalikuba nabo? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ntepasa walakengila mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, kuya kulya shinkwa wishikubengwa kuli Lesa ico calikuba catonda, nkabalikuba basuminishiwa ne mulawo kulya shinkwa uyo sobwe, nsombi beshimilumbo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mpani muliya kubelengapo mu Milawo kwambeti, beshimilumbo nabo balikupwaya mulawo pabusuba bwa Sabata ne kuboneketi baliya mulandu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, mpwali pano wapita Ng'anda ya Lesa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nshinga nemucishi bupandulushi bwa Maswi a Lesa alambangeti, ‘Nkandayandangeti bantu bampe milumbo sobwe, nsombi ndayandangeti bantu benshilenga nkumbo kubanabo. nsuni nkumbo, kupita milumbo, anu ne mutambili bantu babula bwipishi eti bakute bwipishi,’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pakwinga Mwana Muntu emwine busuba bwa Sabata.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga muntu watontola cikasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliko 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mpwalafumapo Yesu walakengila mu ng'anda yakupaililamo, <verse number="10" style="v"/>Umo mwalikuba muntu watontola cikasa, bantu nabambi balikuyanda pakumucaninapo mulandu wakumubepeshela Yesu, balamwipusheti, “Sena Milawo yasuminisha kusengula muntu pabusuba bwa Sabata?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Niyani palinjamwe ukute kambelele kamowa, welela kubula kukatampula kawila mucisengu pa busuba bwa Sabata? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nomba muntu ntewapita mbelele! Na nico ekwambeti Milawo yasuminisha kwinsa byaina pabusuba bwa Sabata.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Neco walamwambila usa muntu, “Tandabula cikasa cakobe!” Nendi walatandabula, popelapo cikasa cakendi calaba cena mbuli cinendi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Popelapo basa Bafalisi balapula kuya kupangana mobelela kumushinina Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wasalwa wa Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalanyumfweti balapangananga, walafumamo. Abo bantu bonse balikumukonkela walikubasengula malwashi onse. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nomba nendi walabakonkomesha kwambeti, kabatamuyubululanga, <verse number="17" style="v"/>walenseco kwambeti ncalamba Lesa kumushinshimi wakendi Yesaya cikwanilishiwe cakwambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“kamubonani, musebenshi wakame uyu ngondalasala,</para>
  <para style="q">Ndimusuni, moyo wakame wakondwa nendi,</para>
  <para style="q">Ninkabike Mushimu mulyendiye.</para>
  <para style="q">Nendi nakakambaukenga shalombolosho kubantu ba mishobo naimbi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nteti akatotekepo, nambi kompolola sobwe,</para>
  <para style="q">Paliya muntu eti akanyumfwepo liswi akendi munshila sha muminshi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nendi nteti akatyokole litete lyomfwama,</para>
  <para style="q">nambi kushima muniko ulayandanga kushimika,</para>
  <para style="q">mpaka cancinencine cikakwane,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kupembelela kwa bantu bonse nikukabikwe mu lina lyakendi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne Belesebulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maliko 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi bantu balaleta muntu washipilwa, kayi utacikonsho kwamba wekatwa ne mishimu yaipa, Yesu walamusengula, walatatika kwamba ne kubona cena. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Bantu bangi balakankamana kabambeti, “Sena uyu nte mwanendi Dafeti?” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nomba Bafalisi mpobalanyumfweco balambeti, “Sobwe, ngofu shakupulisha mishimu yaipa lashifulunga kuli belezebulu mukulene wa mishimu yaipa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu mpwaleshiba ncebalikuyeya walabambileti, “Cishi ciliconse capansana mu makoto makoto ne kutatika kulwana, nkacela kwikalisha nsombi ngaconongeka. Nambi bantu mu munshi, ne mumikowa batatika kubukilana ne kulwana, uwo munshi nambi mukowa nkapelela kuba kunyumfwana sobwe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Na bali mubwami bwa Satana kabapulishana palwabo bene, ekwambeti bapansana, inga bwami bwakendi Satana ngabuyumeconi? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Na ame kamung'ambeti ndapulishinga mishimu yaipa ne ngofu sha belezebulu, inga beshikwiya benu balo balapulishinga mishimu yaipa ne ngofu shabani? Ecebo cakendi beshikwiya benu ebabanga bakamboni pacilubo cenu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Na ame ndapulishinga mishimu yaipa ne ngofu ya Mushimu wa Lesa, anu ekwambeti Lesa latatiki kubika Bwami bwakendi pakati penu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Paliya muntu welela kwingila mu ng'anda ya muntu wangofu kuya kumantamo buboni bwakendi, katanamusunga muntu wangofuyo. Enseco welela kuya kumantamo bintu mung'andomo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Uyo labulunga kubela kulubasu lwakame latotekeshananga nenjame, uyo labulunga kunyamfwako kubunganya, nendi ni shikumwaya. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi ndamwambilishingeti, Lesa nakalekelele bwipishi bonse, ne maswi aipa. Nomba ku muntu lanyanshanga Mushimu Uswepa, Lesa nteti akamulekelelepo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ni cimo cimo uliyense lambilinga Mwana Muntu maswi aipa, Lesa nakamulekeleleko, nomba uliyense lanyanshanga Mushimu Uswepa, Lesa nteti akamulekelelepo sobwe pacino cindi, nambi mucindi cakuntangu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Citondo ne bisepo byakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Na mwambeti citondo ici caina, ekwambeti ne bisepo byakendi byaina, kayi mwambeti, citondo ici caipa, ekwambeti ne bisepo byakendi byaipa, citondo cikute kwishibikwa kubisepo byakendi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Bana banjoka amwe! Ngamucikonsheconi kwamba byaina pakwinga mwaipa? Pakwinga mulomo ukute kwamba byesula mumoyo. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Muntu waina ukute kupulisha byaina kufuma pamulunda wa buboni bwakendi bwaina. Nendi muntu waipa ukute kupulisha byaipa kufuma pamulunda wa buboni bwakendi bwaipa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ndamwambilishingeti pa busuba bwalombolosho, bantu ni bakacanike ne mulandu pa maswi abula kwelela ngobalikwamba, <verse number="37" style="v"/>pakwinga nemaswi akobe nukacaniketi uliya mulandu, kayi maswi akobe nakakupeshe mulandu.</para>
  <para style="s">Bantu balasengenga cingashilo cishikukankamanisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maliko 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose ne Bafalisi balamwambila Yesu eti, “Bashikwiyisha, tulayandanga mutulesheko cingashilo cishikukankamanisha.” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nomba nendi Yesu walambeti, Ha! Kwipa musemano uwu wabantu babula lushomo balayandanga kubona cingashilo cishikukankamanisha, Nomba nteti bakacibonepo sobwe cingashilo kupatulakowa cisa ca mushinshimi Yona. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mbuli Yona usa ncalikuba mulibunda lya luswi lunene lusa masuba atatu, munshi ne mashiku, nendi Mwana Muntu na kabikwe panshi mubulongo masuba atatu, munshi ne mashiku. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Bantu baku Ninive, nibakapundukile pamo ne bantu ba musemanowu pa busuba bwa lombolosho, kwambeti bantu ba ku ninive bakabatotekeko, nte pasa balo balalapa mpobalanyumfwa kukambauka kwa Yona. Nsombi pano mpwali wapita Yona. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Pa busuba bwalombolosho, mwami mutukashi waku Sheba nakapunduke pamo ne bantu bamusemanuwu, nakese akabatoteke. Pakwinga nendi walenda musuma, kwisa kunyumfwa kwamba kwa mano a mwami Solomoni, nomba pano pali wapita Solomoni.</para>
  <para style="s">Kubwelela kwa mushimu waipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Na mushimu waipa ulapulu mu muntu, ukute kuya kwendenda mucishi cabula menshi, kulangaula musena wakupumwininako, nomba nkaukute kucanika. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Neco ukute kwambeti, ndabwelenga kung'anda kwakame kusa nkondalapula, lino washika ukute ucana mung'anda musa muli tonto, mwapyangwa ne kubambwa cena. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ukute kuya kumanta mishimu inendi isanu ne ibili yaipa kupita walo, panyuma pakendi yonse ikute kuya kwingila ne kwikalilila mopelomo. Neco bwikalo bwa muntu uyo bukute kwipa kupita ncalikuba pakutanguna, nicikabeco kumusemanuwu waipa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Banyina ne bakwabo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maliko 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu kacamba ne bantu bangi basa, bakwabo ne banyina balashika, balemana pansa, balikuyanda kwambako nendi. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Lino muntu naumbi walakamwambila Yesu kwambeti, “Banyoko ne bakwenu bali apa pansa balayandanga kwambako ne njobe.” <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Anu bama ni bani? Ne bakwetu nibani?” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Mpwalambeco walatondeka kwalikuba beshikwiya bakendi ne kwambeti, Ame aba e Bama ne bakwetu, <verse number="50" style="v"/>Pakwinga uliyense lenshinga kuyanda kwa Bata ba kwilu, uyo emukwetu mutuloba, enkashi yakame, kayi e Bama.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo washikumwaya mbuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliko 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu pa busuba bopelobo walapula mung'anda, ne kuya kwikala panshi mu mbali mwa lwenje. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kopeleko kwalabungana bantu bangi, Yesu walengila ne kuya kwikala mubwato, bantu bonse balemana kumutunta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu walamba ne bantu aba bintu bingi mumikoshano, walambeti, “Muntu naumbi walaya kumwaya mbuto. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mpwalikumwaya mbuto, nashimbi mbuto shalawila munshila, shalalyewa ne bikeni. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Imbuto nashimbi shalawila pabulongo bwa mabwe, apo palikubula bulongo bwingi, shalamena bwangu pakwinga bulongo nkabwalikuba bwingi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba lisuba mpolyalatako, shalapya ne lumwi, neco shalanyana, pakwinga miyanda nkayalikuba yayapanshi sobwe. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Imbuto nashimbi shalawila pa myunga. Pakukula matewu, myunga yalashinkilila kukula kwa mbuto shisa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba mbuto nashimbi shalawila pa bulongo bwabolela cena, shalasema mifuko ingi namumbi mwalikuba nseke mwanda, namumbi nseke makumi asanu ne limo, namumbi nseke makumi atatu, kupita shalabyalwa” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Uyo ukute matwi, anyumfwe!”</para>
  <para style="s">Ncelambanga mikoshanyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliko 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi beshikwiya ba Yesu balamwipusheti, “Inga nipacebo cini bantu aba ncomulambanga nabo mumikoshanyo?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nendi walambeti, “Amwe Lesa walamuyubulwila byasolekwa bya Bwami bwa kwilu, nsombi kuli nabambi uliya kubayubulwilapo sobwe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ukuteko kantu nibakamupeko nabimbi, nakabe ne bintu bingi. Nomba uyo wabula kantu kalikonse, ne kang'anako nkakute nibaka mulamune. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ncondambilinga mumikoshanyo ne bantu aba nicebo cakwambeti, nambi balalanganga, nkabalabononga sobwe, nambi balanyumfunga, nkabalanyufunga nambi kunyumfwishisha sobwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ebantu aba balakwanilisha ncalikwamba mushinshimi Yesaya,”</para>
  <para style="q">“Kunyumfwa nimukanyumfwenga, nsombi nteti mukanyumfwishishenga</para>
  <para style="q">kubona nimukabonenga, nsombi nteti mukabonesheshenga sobwe.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Cakubinga myoyo yabantu yafumpa,</para>
  <para style="q">bashinka bishili mumatwi mwabo,</para>
  <para style="q">bacala menso abo.</para>
  <para style="q">Ne calabula kubeco, ngababona ne menso abo.</para>
  <para style="q">ngabanyumfwa ne matwi abo,</para>
  <para style="q">mano abo ngaishiba</para>
  <para style="q">ne kushinta myoyo,</para>
  <para style="q">kwambeti ame ndibasengule.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Nombamwe menso enu alelekwa pakwinga alabononga, nawo matwi enu alanyumfunga. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwamba cakubinga, bashinshimi ne bantu bangi balulama balikuyandishisha kubona bintu ibi mbyomulabononga, nsombi balo baliya kubibonapo sobwe, balikuyandishisha kunyumfwa mbyomulanyumfunga, nsombi baliya kubinyumfwapo sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapandululunga mukoshanyo wa shikumwaya mbuto,</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maliko 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Amwe lino munyumfwishishe bupandulushi bwa mukoshanyo wa muntu usa walikumwaya mbuto. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Muntu uliyense anyumfwa Maswi, kwakubula kwanyumfwishisha, Waipa ukute kwisakufunyamo Maswi abyalwa mumoyo, Ishi embuto shisa shalabyalwa munshila. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Imbuto shalabyalwa pabulongo bwa mabwe shilapandululunga muntu ukute kunyumfwa Maswi ne kwatambula mwabwangu bwangu mwakukondwa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lino pacebo cakubula miyanda yashimpa cena, ukute kulikakatishako kwakacindi kang'anowa, cakwinseti aba mumapensho ne kunyumfwa bishikubaba pacebo ca Maswi asa, muntuyo ukute kubwelela panyuma pacindi copeleco. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Imbuto shisa shalabyalwa pa myunga shilapandululunga muntu ukute kunyumfwa Maswi a Lesa, nomba cebo cakutatilwa ne bintu byapacishi ne kuyandishisha mali, kukute kutyompwesha kukula kwa Maswi asa, neco nkakute kusemapo bisepo sobwe. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nomba mbuto shisa shalabyalwa pabulongo bwabolela shilapandululunga muntu uyo ukute kwatambula Maswi a Lesa ne kwanyumfwishisha, Muntuyu ukute kusema bisepo, mwanda, nacimbi cindi makumi asanu ne limo, nambi makumi atatu a bishango byalabyalwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa musonde ne maila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu walabambila kayi mukoshanyo naumbi, walambeti, “Bwami bwakwilu bwakoshana ne muntu walabyala mbuto shaina mulibala lyakendi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nomba cindi ncobalikuba bonatulo bantu bonse, mulwani wakendi walesa kubyalamo musonde pakati pa maila, ne kufumapo. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lino mumena wa maila mpowalikukula nekuba ne mapumpu, nawo musonde walatatika kuboneka.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Basebenshi bakendi mwine libala usa, balamwipusheti, “Nkambo, sena nte mwalabyalamo'wa mbuto shaina mulibala lyenu? Inga nawo musonde ulabonekenga mongeconi?” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nendi walabakumbuleti, “Nimulwani wakame wenseco,” Nabo basebenshi balamwipusha kayi, “Sena twenga tutumunemo?” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Walambeti, “Sobwe! Mwenseco ngamutumwina kumo ne maila mwatumunanga musonde uwo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kamubilekani bikulile pamo mpaka cindi cakucesa. Pacindico ninkambile beshikucesa Kamucesani nanshi musonde, musunge mitolo mitolo, muutente. Panyuma pakendi mubunganye maila ne kuya kwabika mu lyanga lyakame.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa nseke shakatondo ka masitadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maliko 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu walabapa mukoshanyo naumbi walambeti, “Bwami bwakwilu bulyeti nseke shakatondo ka masitadi ako muntu nkalakabyala mulibala lyakendi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nseke shakatondo aka ni shing'anashing'ana mwelanisha ne nseke nashimbi. Nomba mbuto yakendi yakula, ikute kupita bifukusa nabimbi, ikute kuba citondo cinene, umo bikeni bikute kwisa kwibakamo bisangala mu misampi yakendi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa cishikufufumusha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu walabapa mukoshanyo naumbi kayi, walambeti, “Bwami bwakwilu bulyeti cishikufufumisha shinkwa, ico mutukashi naumbi ncalasankanya pamo ne bunga bwakwana bikopo bibili, mpaka bunga bonse bwalafufumuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu byonsebi walikubambila bantu mumikoshanyo, pacindici uliya kwambapo nabo cintu ciliconse kwabula mukoshanyo. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Uko kwalikuba kukwanilisha calambwa ne mushinshimi, kwambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ninkambenga nabo mumikoshanyo,</para>
  <para style="q">Ninkayubulule byalikuba byasolekwa</para>
  <para style="q">kufuma pakulengwa kwacishi capanshi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapandululunga mukoshanyo wa Musonde ne Maila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu walashiya makoto abantu basa, ne kuya kwingila mung'anda, beshikwiya bakendi balamusengeti, “Kamutupandulwilako mukoshanyo wa musonde wa mulibala usa.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Yesu nendi walambeti, Usa shikumwaya mbuto shaina endiye Mwana Muntu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Libala lisa ecishi cino capanshi. Shisa mbuto shaina ebantu bene Bwami bwa Lesa. Musonde ni bantu baipa bakendi Waipa usa. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mulwani usa walabyala musonde ni Muyungaushi. Kucesa maila kusa ekupwa kwacishi capanshi, ne beshikucesa ni bangelo. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mbuli ncobalabunganya musonde ne kutenta pamulilo, nicikabeco pakupwa kwa cishicapanshi <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mwana Muntu nakatume bangelo bakendi, kwisa kufunyamo mu Bwami bwakendi bantu bonse bakute kwipisha banabo, pamo ne bonse bamicito yaipa. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nibakabawale mubufuni bwa mulilo, kopeloko nibakalilenga ne kukokota meno. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nomba bantu balulama nibakabaleti lisuba mu Bwami bwa Bameshabo, Uyo ukute matwi, anyumfwe!</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa mali asolekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Bwami bwakwilu ngatubwelanika cisa; Muntu naumbi walafumbula mali asolekwa mulibala. neye kayi walafumbika pambi, panyuma pakendi mwakukondwa, walakaulisha bintu byonse mbyalikukute ne kuya kula libala lisa.</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshano wa malungu amulo wadula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>“Kayi Bwami bwakwilu ngatubwelanika cisa; Muntu naumbi shimakwebo, walayakulangaula malungu a mulo wadula. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mpwalacana libwe limo lya mulo wadula, walaya kuyakulisha bintu byonse mbyalikukute ne kuyakula libwe lyamulo wadula lisa ndyalikuyandishisha.</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa kombe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Bwami bwakwilu ngatubwelanika cisa; Basulishi balawala kombe mulwenje nekubungulula nswi sha mishobo yonse, <verse number="48" style="v"/>kesula bakute kukakwelela kumutunta, bakute kwikala panshi nekutatika kusalapo nswi shaina kababika mu mitanga, shaipa nikushitaya. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nicikenshikeco pakupwa kwacishici, bangelo nibakafunyepo bantu baipa pakati pa bantu balulama, <verse number="50" style="v"/>ne kubawala mubufuni bwamulilo, kopeloko nibakalilenga ne kukokota meno.”</para>
  <para style="s">Buboni bwakaindi ne bwalinolino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu walabepusha beshikwiya bakendi, “Sena mulanyumfwishishi cena bintu ibi byonse?” Balo balambeti, “Ee” <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kayi walabambileti, “Ecebo cakendi shikwiyisha uliyense wa milawo laba shikwiya wa Bwami bwakwilu, ulyeti mwine ng'anda uyo ukute kupulisha bintu bya linolino ne byakaindi kufuma mulyanga lya buboni bwakendi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Balamukananga Yesu ku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliko 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalapwisha kwamba mikoshanyo walafumako. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Mpwalashika mucibela cakucomwabo, walatatika kwiyisha bantu mu ng'anda yakupaililamo. Abo balikumunyumfwa balikunkamana ne kwipusheti, “Mano, ne ngofu shakankamanisha shilicisa muntuyu walashifunya kupeyo? <verse number="55" style="v"/>Sena uyu nte mwana wa shikupala mapulanga usa? Sena nte mwanendi Maliya? Sena bamakwabo nte Jemusi ne Yosefe ne Shimoni ne Yuda? <verse number="56" style="v"/>Sena nkashi shakendi shonse ntetulinasho pamo pano? Inga bintu ibi walabicana kupeyo?” <verse number="57" style="v"/>Neco balamusula, nomba nendi Yesu walabambileti, Mushinshimi nkakute kupewa bulemu ne banse bendi mbaikala nabo mumunshi, nsombi bantu bakumbi. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Neco, Yesu uliya kwinsako bintu bingi byangofu, pacebo cakubula lushomo kwabo.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lufu lwa Yohane Mubatishi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliko 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco, mwami Helode waku Galileya walanyumfwa bintu byalikwamba bantu mbyalikwinsa Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Walambila bantu bakendi bamakulene, “Uyu ingakali Yohane Mubatishi usa elapunduku kubafu! Ecebo cakendi ncalenshilinga bishikunkamanisha bilicisa.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pakwinga Helode ewalatuma bashilikali kuyakwikata Yohane, ne kumubika mujele. Walenseco pacebo ca Helodiya, walikuba mukashi wa Filipo, mukwabo Helode. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pakwinga Yohane walamwambila Helode kwambeti, “Mulawo nkawasuminisha amwe kumweba uyu mutukashi,” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ncalikuyanda Helode nikushina Yohane, nsombi walikutina bantu, pakwinga bantu balikwambeti Yohane nimushinshimi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mpobwalashika busuba bwa kwanuka kusemwa kwa Helode, mwana mutukashi wa Helodiya walashana pamenso pa bantu bonse balakwiwa ku malyalya awo, Helode walakondwa, <verse number="7" style="v"/>cakwinseti walensa kulumbileti, “Cakubinga nditu ninkupe ciliconse ncoti usenge.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lino banyina balamwambila cintu ncoti engakusenga. Mwana mutukashi usa walambeti, “Kamumpani mumbale popelepano mutwi wa Yohane mubatishi.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mwami Helode walanyumfwa nsoni, nomba pacebo ca kulumbila kusa, kayi ne bantu basa mbwalakuwa kumalyalya asa, walambeti, “Mwana mutukashuyu apewe mutwi ngwalasenge.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Popelapo walatuma muntu kuya kumutimbula mutwi Yohane mujele. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Walaumantila mumbale mutwi ne kutwala kumwana mutukashi, nendi walautwala ku banyina. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi beshikwiya bakendi Yohane balesa kumanta citumbi ne kuyakubika mumanda, kufumapo balayakumwambila Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalyeshenga bantu myanda makumi asanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohane 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalanyumfweco walatanta bwato ne kufumako, ne kuya kumusena kwabula bantu. Nomba bantu mpobalanyumfweti Yesu lafumuko balamukonkela ne myendo kufuma muminshi yabo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalabona likoto lyabantu, walaseluka mubwato, walabanyumfwila nkumbo, kayi walatatika kusengula balwashi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi pacindi camansailo, Yesu balamwambileti, “Kuno nikucisuwa, ano nimansailo kamubambilani bantu aba benga kuminshi bengakula byakulya.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nomba nendi Yesu walabambileti, “Nkabelela kuya kumbi, amwe nimubape cakulya.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Balo balambeti, “Tukutekowa shinkwa usanu, ne nswi shibili.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “kamuletani kuno.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mpobalamutwalila, Yesu walambila bantu baseti bekale panshi pa mila, Yesu walamanta shinkwa usanu ne nswi shibili, walalungumana kulanga kwilu, ne kulumba Lesa, panyuma pakendi walakomona komona shinkwa usa ne kupa beshikwiya bakendi, nabo balayabila bantu bonse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balalya ne kwikuta. Panyuma pakendi beshikwiya balayowela byalashala ne kwisusha mitanga likumi ne ibili. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balikubapo balalya, balikuba batuloba myanda makumi asanu kutabelengela kumo batukashi ne bana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lendenga pamenshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohane 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco, Yesu walambila beshikwiya bakendi kwambeti batante bwato batangune kuya kutala, nendi walashalila kunyuma kacambila bantu eti benga kwabo. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mpwalalayana ne bantu basa, Yesu walatanta mumulundu kuyakupaila enka, palatatika kushipuluka kacili kopeloko enka. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pacindici bwato busa bwalikuba pakati pa lwenje, patali ne kumutunta, kabapenga kukwasula cebo camankape, pakwinga balikabalwana ne lukupwe lunene. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Cindi cakumaca kakutubuluka Yesu walesa nkobalikuba kesakwenda pa menshi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi mpobalamubona kenda pamenshi, balatina, balambeti, “Nicipuku!” Balatatika kutamauka cebo ca buyowa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu pacindi copeleco walabambileti, “Kamwikalikani cali! Njame, kamutatina sobwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nendi Petulo walambeti, “Nkambo, na njamwe kamunsuminisha ne njame njise uko pamenshi,” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walambeti, “Kwesa!” Petulo nendi walafuma mubwato, ne kutatika kwenda pamenshi kuya kuli Yesu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mpwalabona kukonempa kwalukupwe walaba ne buyowa, walatatika kwibila, walatatika kubilikisheti, “Nkambo, kamumpulushako!” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu popelapo walatandabula cikasa ne kumwikata, ne kwambeti, “Obe okute lushomo lung'ana ulatonshanini cani?” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi bonse babili balaya kwingila mubwato busa ne lukupwe lwalacileka. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Beshikwiya basa balikuba mu bwato balamukambilila Yesu ne kwambeti, “Cakubinga njamwe Mwanendi Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga balwashi ku Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maliko 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lino bonse balatampuka lwenje ne kushika ku Genesaleti. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bantu bakucishico balamwishiba Yesu, balaya kwishibisha banabo mucibela conse, neco balaleta balwashi bonse kuli Yesu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Balamusengeti abasuminishe balwashi bekatekowa mwinjila wakendi, cakubinga bonse balekatako balikusengulwa.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Miyambo yabakulu kulu Baciyuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maliko 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Busuba nabumbi Bafalisi ne beshikwiyisha Milawo ya Mose nabambi balesa kuli Yesu kufumina ku Yelusalemu, balamwipusheti, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nipacebo cini beshikwiya benu nkabalasungunga mwambo wa bakulukulu? Nkabalasambanga kumakasa balyanga cakulya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Inga ne njamwe mukute kusulila cani Milawo ya Lesa, ne kuyuminina nta ku mwambo wamashali benu bakulukulu?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lesa walambeti, “Kopa bulemu baiso ne banyoko kayi kwambeti, uyo lanyanshanga baishi ne banyina welela kushinwa nditu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nsombi amwe mukute kwambeti, ‘Muntu ambila baishi, nambi banyina, eti, mbyondayandanga kumunyamfwani, ndabibenge kuli Lesa, <verse number="6" style="v"/>nteko kwambeti uyo uliya kupa bulemu baishi,’ Cebo ca mwambo wenuwo Maswi a Lesa akute kuba abulyo.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Amwe bantu bandemi shibili, mushinshimi Yesaya walamba cakubinga mpwalambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Bantu aba bakute kumpa bulemu bwa pamulomo</para>
  <para style="q">nsombi moyo wabo ulikutali ne njame.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ee, bakute kunkambilila,</para>
  <para style="q">nsombi kunkambilila kulico ni kwabulyo,</para>
  <para style="q">pakwinga mbyobakute kwiyisha,</para>
  <para style="q">nteyo milawo yakame, nsombi niya bantu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Bikute kwipisha muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maliko 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi Yesu walabakuwa bantu basa, kwambeti bese pepi ne kubambileti, “Kamunyumfwani, kayi munyumfwishishe cena, <verse number="11" style="v"/>cintu cikute kwingila mu mulomo, nteco cikute kwipisha muntu sobwe, nsombi cisa cikute kupula pamulomo pakendi endico cikute kwipisha muntu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Popelapo beshikwiya bakendi nabo balamwipusheti, “Sena mucinshi kwambeti mubalabanyufwishi nsoni Bafalisi ne ncomulamba?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Imbuto iliyonse yabula kubyalwa ne Bata bakwilu, ni katumunwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Balekeni, aba nibatangunishi bashipilwa babantu bashipilwa, Lino na washipilwa utangunina washipilwa munendi, babili bonse ni bakawile mucisengu.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pacindici nendi Petulo walamwipusha Yesu kwambeti, “Tupandululwileni mukoshanyowu.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Anu ne njamwe kayi nkamulanyumfwishishinga? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Sena kamucinshi kwambeti, ciliconse cilengilinga mumulomo cikute kwingila mulibunda mwakendi, ne kuya kucitaila kucisuwa? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nomba bilapulunga mu mulomo wa muntu bikute kufuma mumoyo, neco, ibi ebikute kumwipisha. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pakwinga mu myoyo ya bantu emukute kufuma manjeyaulwa aipa, nambi akushina nambi abupombo nambi abufule nambi akwiba nambi abukamboni bwabwepeshi, kayi ne abufwiyishi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ibi ebikute kwipisha muntu. Nteko kulya cakulya kwakubula kusamba kumakasa sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lushomo lwa mutukashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maliko 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu walafumako, ne kuya kubibela bya Tulo ne Sidoni. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mutukashi naumbi mu Kenani wamucibela ca kopeloko, walesa kuli Yesu, kabilikisheti, “Kamunyumfwilako nkumbo, Nkambo, Mobana bendi Dafeti. Mwaname mutukashi lapenge kwine pakwinga wekatwa ne mushimu waipa.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu uliya kumukumbulapo. Beshikwiya bakendi Yesu balesa kumusengeti, “Anu kamumwambilani enga, bonani latuyobekelenga.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walambeti, “Ame ndalatumwa ku mbelele shataika sha Baislayeli.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mutukashi usa walasuntama, ne kwambeti, “Kamunyamfwilishako Nkambo.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Nkacaina kupa bakabwa cakulya cabana.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mutukashi usa walambeti, “Ee, nicakubinga Nkambo, nomba ntepasa bakabwa bakute nabo kubweselela bilalakanga panshi alyanga mwine ng'anda.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walambeti, “Obe mutukashi lushomo lwakobe ni lunene, cinshike nditu ncolayandanga.” Popelapo mwanendi mutukashi usa walabacena.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga bantu bangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kufumapo, Yesu walaya kwendana mu mbali mwa lwenje lwa Galileya, kayi walatanta mulundu ne kwikala panshi kopeloko. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nomba bantu bangi balesa kuli Yesu, balamuletela balwashi, balema myendo ne bashipilwa ne balemana ne bacibulu ne nabambi. mpobalikubaleta pantangu pakendi, walikabasengula bonse. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lino bantu bangi balakankamana, pakubona bacibulu kabamba, balemana kabasengulwa, balema myendo basa kabenda, kayi bashipilwa kabacikonsha kubona, neco balamutembaula Lesa wa Baislayeli.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalyeshenga bantu bapita myanda makumi ana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maliko 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu walakuwa beshikwiya bakendi nekubambileti, “Ame ndabanyumfwilinga luse bantu aba, pakwinga balekala ne njame kwa masuba atatu, kayi kwakubula cakulya. Nkansuni kubambileti, benga kwabo ne nsala kabatana balyapo, pakwinga ngabawisuka bayanga munshila.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi balamwipusheti, “Inga kucisuwa kuno ngatucicana kupeyo cakulya celela kukwana bantu bangi cisa?” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabepusheti, “Inga mukuteko shinkwa ungaye?” Balo balamukumbuleti, “Usanu ne ubili, kayi ne tunswi twakubelengowa.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu walabambila bantu basa kwambeti bekale panshi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi walamanta shinkwa usanu ne ubili usa ne nswi, walalumba Lesa, ne kukomona komona shinkwa, walapa beshikwiya bakendi, nabo balayabila bantu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balalya, balekuta. Balayowela byalashalapo ne kwisusha mitanga isanu ne ibili. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lino bantu bonse pamo balalya balikuba batuloba myanda makumi ana, kutabelengela kumo batukashi ne batwanike. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Panyuma pakulayana ne bantu basa, Yesu walatanta bwato walaya kucibela ca Magadani.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Bafalisi neba Saduki balasengenga cishibisho cikankamanisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maliko 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kayi Bafalisi ne Basaduki nabambi balesa kuli Yesu kwisa kumwelekesha pakumwipusheti, abaleshe cishibisho ceshikufuma kwilu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nomba nendi Yesu walabambileti, “Mansailo mwaboneti kwilu kwafubela pyuu, mukute kwambeti lilo nibukace cena, <verse number="3" style="v"/>kayi bwaca mukute mwambeti, ‘Lelo niloke mfula yamabwe, pakwinga kwilu kwafubela ciyosha, kayi kuli makumbi ashipa mbii.’ Mukute kucikonsha kupandulula mbuli ncokulabonekenga kwilu ku makumbi, nomba cilalanga kupandulula bishibisho byapacindi cino. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Musemano wa bantu baipa, kayi babula lushomo, balayandanga cishibisho cishikukankamanisha? Paliyawa cishibisho ncoti bakapewe capita cisa ca Yona.” Yesu mpwalambeco walafumapo nekuya kumbi.</para>
  <para style="s">Biyisho byabwepeshi bya Bafalisi ne Basaduki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maliko 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mpobalikutampuka kuya kutala kwa lwenje, beshikwiya balalubako kumanta shinkwa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Mucenjele ne cishikufufumusha ca Bafalisi neca Basaduki.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi balatatika kwamba pa lwabo beneti, lambangeco pakwinga tuliya kumanta shinkwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu walenshiba ncobalikwamba, neco walabepusheti, “Inga nipacebo cini ncomulambilingeti muliya shinkwa? Kucepa lushomo ndomukute mobantu amwe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mpaka pacino cindi mobantu amwe mucili mungubi? Sena nkamulanukunga kwambeti, ne shinkwa usanu, ndalalyesha bantu myanda makumi asanu? Inga mwalesusha mitanga ingaye ya byashalapo? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pacindi nacimo cisa ne shinkwa usanu ne ubili ndalalyesha bantu myanda makumi ana, inga mwalesusha mitanga ingaye ya byashalapo? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Cilamwalilingeconi kwinshibeti, nkandambanga sha shinkwa? Kamucenjelani ne cishikufufumusha ca Bafalisi ne Basaduki.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apa lino empobaleshibeti, Yesu nkalikwambeti bacenjele ne cishikufufumusha shinkwa, nsombi kwambeti bacenjele ne biyisho bya Bafalisi ne Ba saduki.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni Mupuluhi Wasalwa ne Lesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maliko 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalashika ku bibela bya Kaisaleya waku Filipi, walabepusha beshikwiya bakendi, “Inga bantu balambangeti Mwana Muntu niyani?” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Balo balambeti, “Nabambi balambangeti Mwana Muntu ni Yohane mubatishi, nabambi eti Mwana Muntu ni Eliya nabambi, eti Mwana Muntu ni Yelemiya, nambi umo wa bashinshimi.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu walabepusha beshikwiya bakendi, “Inga amwe, mukute kwambeti ame njame bani?” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nendi Shimoni Petulo walakumbuleti, “Amwe njamwe Klistu, Mwanendi Lesa muyumi” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walamwambileti, “Walelekwa njobe, Shimoni mwanendi Yona, pakwinga lakuyubulwili ici nte muntu sobwe, nsombi ni Bata balikwilu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ame ndambangeti, lino obe njobe Petulo, nomba palibwe lyacandanshi ili ninkebakepo mubungano. Kayi lufu nteti lukakomepo mubungano. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ninkakupe makiyi akucalwisha Bwami bwakwilu, neco ncoti mukasungenga panshi pano, nicikasungwenga ne kwilu, kayi ibyo mbyoti mukasungululenga panshi pano, nibikasungululwenga ne kwilu.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalambeco walabambila beshikwiya eti, kabatambilanga bantu kwambeti endiye Klistu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambanga sha lufu nekupunduka kwakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maliko 8:31—9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kufuma cindico, Yesu walatatika kubeshibishila limo beshikwiya bakendi kwambeti, “Ndelela kuya ku Yelusalemu, uko bamakulene Baciyuda, ne bamakulene ba beshimilumbo, ne beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose, nkoti bakampenshe cikamba. Nibakanshine, nsombi pabusuba bwa butatu kayi ninkapundushiwe kubuyumi.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Petulo mpwalanyumfweco, walamumanta Yesu pambali ne kumukansa, walambeti, “Sobwe Nkambo, ici kacitenshika, Lesa katacisuminisha kwambeti cinshike,” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walacebuka ne kumukalalila Petulo mwangofu, walambeti, “Fumapa, Satana obe! Ulayandanga kuncimwisha! Kuyeya kwakobe nteko kwa Lesa sobwe, nsombi ni kwabuntu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kumanta lusanda ne kukonka Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalambeco, beshikwiya bakendi walabambileti, “Muntu layandanga kukonka ame, alikane mwine, kayi alimantile mwine lusanda ankonke. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pakwinga layandanga kupulusha buyumi bwakendi nakabutaye. Nomba uyo latayanga buyumi bwakendi pacebo cakame, nakabucane. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Inga nicani ncenga ucanapo, na muntu uba ne bintu byonse byapano pacishi, nomba nendi usomekapo kabeshi ne kutaya buyumi bwakendi? Anu muntu ngaubenga cani kwambeti alubule buyumi bwakendi?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Neco nditu Mwana Muntu lakesanga pamo ne bangelo bakendi mubulemu bwa Baishi. Popelapo nakabweshele muntu uliyense kwelana ne ncito shakendi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, popele pano mpobali nabambi beti bakabule kufwa, kabatana bamubona Mwana Muntu kesa mubulemu bwa Bwami.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kusanduka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maliko 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mpopalapita masuba asanu ne limo, Yesu walamantapo Petulo, Jemusi ne Yohane mukwabo, walatanta nabo pamulundu utali kwabonka. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lino cinso ca Yesu calasanduka kababona, cinso cakendi calabala tuu mbuli lisuba, ne byakufwala byakendi byalabeka mbee. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Popelapo Mose ne Eliya balabonekela kulyendibo kababandika ne Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mpwalaboneco, Petulo walambila Yesu, kwambeti, “Nkambo, cilabacena kwambeti, mpotuli pano, anu na kamusuni, nitwibake mishasha itatu, umo wenu, naumbi wa Mose, naumbi ube wa Eliya.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kacambeco likumbi lituba lyalesa kubafwekelela, umo mulikumbi mwalanyumfwika Liswi lyakwambeti, “Uyu e Mwaname ngonsuni, mulyendiye ndakondwa, Kamumunyumfwilani.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mpobalanyumfweco, beshikwiya basa balatina kwine, balawa panshi cakufulumana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walesa kubekata, ne kwambeti, “Pundukani kamutaba ne buyowa.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba mpobalenamuka, paliya muntu ngobalabonapo sobwe, nsombi Yesu enka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mpobalikuseluka pa mulundu usa Yesu walabambileti, “Mbyomulabono mucimbonimboni, kamutaya mwambileko uliyense, mpaka Mwana Muntu akapundushiwe kubafu.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Beshikwiya basa balamwipusheti, “Inga nipacebo cini beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose ncobakute kwambileti, Eliya ewelela kutanguna kwisa?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Nicakubinga Eliya ewelela kutanguna kwisa kubamba bintu byonse. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nomba ndamwambilishingeti, Eliya walesa kendi, bantu ebabula kumwingashila, nsombi balamwinshila bintu byonse mbyobalikuyanda kulyendiye. Nicimo cimo Mwana Muntu nendi nibakamupenshe.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Popelapo beshikwiya balenshibeti wambanga sha Yohane mubatishi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga mwana mutuloba wekatwa ne mishimu yaipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maliko 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luka 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mpobalabwelela kusa kwalikuba likoto lyabantu, naumbi muntu walesa kusuntama kuli Yesu, <verse number="15" style="v"/>walambeti, “Nkambo kamumunyumfwilako nkumbo, mwaname ukute bulwashi bwa kashita, lapenge, cindi conse ukute kuwila pamulilo, ne pamenshi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ndanga ndesa nendi kuli beshikwiya benu aba, nomba balalilwa kumusengula.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Ha! Amwe musemano wa bantu babula lushomo, bamiyeyo yalunkanwa, ninjikale nenu kushika cindi cini sena? Ndelela kulishishibisha kushika cindi citali cilyeconi sena? Kamumuletani kuno uyo mwana.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu walaukalalila mushimu waipa, popelapo walafuma mu mwana. Pacindi copeleco walaba cena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi beshikwiya balesa kuli Yesu pambali ne kumwipusheti, “Inga twalilwaconi afwe kupulisha mushimu waipa usa?” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Cebo cakendi ni cakwambeti lushomo lwenu nilung'ana, cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, nambi lushomo lwenu kaluli nilung'ana mbuli kambuto ka katondo ka masitadi, nimukambile mulundu uwu eti, ‘Fumapa, koya uko,’ Mulunduwo nukafumepo, paliya cintu ceshi cikamwalilenga pimbi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f"/> “Kwambeti mupulishe mushimu wa mushobowu, mwelela nanshi kupaila ne kulikanisha kulya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambanga shakufwa nekupunduka kwakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliko 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mpobalabungana beshikwiya bonse ku Galileya, Yesu walabambileti, “Mwana Muntu lenga mu makasa abantu, <verse number="23" style="v"/>betibakamushine Nsombi pabusuba wabutatu nakapundushiwe.” Beshikwiya mpobalanyumfweco, balongumana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu labengenga musonko wa Ng'anda ya Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi mpobalashika ku Kapelenawo, beshikusonkesha musonko wa Ng'anda ya Lesa, balamwipusha Petulo, “Sena Shikwiyisha wenu Yesu, nkakute kusonkako musonko waku Ng'anda ya Lesa?” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nendi Petulo walambeti, “Ee, ukute kusonka.” Lino Petulo mpwalengila mung'anda katanamba ciliconse. Yesu walamwipusheti, “Obe Shimoni ulayeyenga cani? Inga bami bapano pacishi bakute kutambula misonko kufuma kuli bani,” Kubantu bamushobo wabo, nambi bensu? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Petulo walambeti, “Kubensu,” Nendi Yesu walamwambileti, “Anu nanico bantu bamushobo wabo nkabelela kusonkako sobwe. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nomba kwambeti, katutabapesha nsoni baku Ng'anda ya Lesa, koya kulwenje kuya kulobola. Luswi ndoti utangune kulobola ulucenamune mulomo, nucanemo lyali, Ulimante uye usonke, kayi ne njame uye unsonkeleko.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Inga mukulene niyani?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliko 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco beshikwiya ba Yesu balesa kulyendiye nekumwipusheti, “Inga niyani eshakabe mukulene wapita bonse mu Bwami bwa kwilu?” <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu walakuwa mwana ne kumwimanika pakati pabo, <verse number="3" style="v"/>ne kwambeti, “Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, mwabula kusanduka, ne kubeti mwana uyu, nteti mukengile mu Bwami bwa kwilu pimbi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi muntu uliyense lalicepeshenga mbuli mwana uyu, epeloyo emukulene wapita, mu Bwami bwa kwilu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kayi uliyense latambulunga mwana ulyeti uyu pacebo cakame, endiye kayi lantambulunga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Bishikwipisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maliko 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Uliyense lapeshengeti umo wabana bakute lushomo muli njame kwambeti bapuntwe, celela kuba cena kumusungilila cilibwe camwampelo munshingo ne kumuwala mulwenje.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="18:6">Bantu babili balasebenseshenga mwampelo kupela</figure> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Malele kubantu bapacishi capanshi pano, cebo cakufula kwabwipishi, Naboyo bwipishi nkabwelela kubula kuboneka, nomba malele kumuntu uyo lapeshengeti banendi bapuntwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Lino na cikasa cakobe, nambi mwendo wakobe, ukute kukwipisha, kotimbula utaye, caina kuya kwingila ku buyumi koli watimbuka cikasa, nambi mwendo, kupita kuwalwa kumulilo utapu kokute makasa onse, nambi myendo yonse ibili. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kayi na linso lyakobe lilakwipishinga, likolobolemo ulitaye, caina kuya kwingila ku buyumi kokute linso limo'wa, kupita kuwalwa mu Gehena kokute menso abili.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa mbelele yalubila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Cenjelani, kamutanyansha umo wa bana batwanike aba, cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, bangelo bakwilu nkobali cindi conse pamenso a Bata bakwilu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f"/> <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mwana Muntu walesa kupulusha bantu bataika. <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Inga mwinseconi, na muntu kakute mbelele mwanda umo, imo itaika, sena nkelela kushiya mbelele shisa makumi asanu, ne ana, ne na shimbi shisanu ne shina mumilundu, ne kuya kulangaula imo isa ilataiki? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ndamwambilinga cakubinga kwambeti, aicana ukute kusekelela kupita kusekelela ne shisa shilabulu kutaika. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nicimo cimo Ba meshenu bakwilu nkabasuni kwambeti umo wabana batwanike aba ataike?”</para>
  <para style="s">Byakwinsa mwanse alakwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Na mwanse wakobe lakwipishili koya kulyendiye, wenga umuleshe cilubo cakendi, mubandike pambali mobabili, na mulanyumfwana ekwambeti ulamubweshe munshila, <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nomba na ubula kukunyumfwila, umantepo umo nambi babili, nambi batatu. kwambeti makani nakashininkishiwe ne bukamboni bwa bantu babili nambi batatu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Na naboyo ubula kubanyumfwila,wambileko bamubungano. Kayi na ubula kunyumfwila bamubungano, komubonangeti muntu wamishobo naimbi, nambi shimisonko.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, ciliconse ncoti mukasunge panshi pano, nicikasungwe kwilu, kayi ciliconse nceti mukasungulule panshi pano, nicikasungululwe kwilu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kayi cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, mwanyumfwana mobabili pacishi capanshi, pakusenga cintu ciliconse, Bata bakwilu nibakamwinshile. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pali babili, nambi batatu balabungana mu Lina lyakame, ame mpondi pakati pabo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa musebenshi utalekelele munendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Popelapo Petulo walesa kuli Yesu, ne kumwipusheti, “Nkambo, na mukwetu kapitilishowa kunjipishila, ngandimulekelela tunkanda tungaye? Sena nganshikisha tunkanda tusanu ne tubili?” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Sena ndambangowa tunkanda tusanu ne tubili, sobwe, nsombi tunkanda makumi asanu ne abili kufulisha tunkanda tusanu ne tubili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lino Bwami bwa kwilu tubwelanishe cisa. Palikuba mwami uyo walakuwa basebenshi bakendi kwambeti, abone cena nkongole nshobalikukute. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mpwalatatika kubasesa, kwalacanika musebenshi naumbi walikukute nkongole ya mali angi akwana bina myanda myanda. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mpwalalilwa kubwesha nkongole, Mwami walambeti, musebenshi usa aulishiwe ne mukashendi ne banabendi, ne bintu byonse mbyalikukute, kwambeti nkongole isa ipwe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Musebenshi usa walasuntama nekufulungana panshi pamenso pa mwami ne kukombeleleti, “Kamupembelelako pang'ana ninkabweshe nkongole yonse.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mwami usa walanyumfwila luse, ne kumulekelela nkongole yonse, ne kumusuminisheti, ayenga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nomba uyu musebenshi mpwalapula, walakumanya musebenshi munendi walikumukutile nkongole ya mali akwana mwanda umo. Walamwikata mwabukalu ne kumutinga panshingo, ne kumwambileti, “Bwesha nkongole isa!” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Musebenshi munendi usa walaliwisha panshi kumyendo yakendi ne kumukombeleleti, Kamupembelelako pang'ana, ninkabweshe nkongole njonkute kuli njamwe. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nendi walakana kumulekelela, walamusungisha mujele, kushikila akabweshe nkongole.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Basebenshi nabambi mpobalabona calenshika, balepilwa kwine. Neco balaya kumwambila mwami bintu byonse. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mwami usa walamukuwa, ne kumwambileti, “Musebenshi waipa obe! Ame ndalakulekelela nkongole yonse mpowalankombelela. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Sena nkowanga welela kumwinshila nkumbo ne kumulekelela munobe mbuli ame ncondakwinshila nkumbo ne kukulekelela?” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mwami usa walakalala, neco walamuwala mujele kwambeti bakamupenshe, kushikla akabweshe nkongole isa,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu walapwisha kwamba pakwambeti “Ici encoti bakense Bata bakwilu kuli umo ne umo, uyo utalekelele munendi ne moyo wonse.”</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambanga sha kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maliko 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalapwisha kwamba, walafumako ku Galileya, walaya mucibela ca Yudeya kutala kwa mulonga wa Yolodani. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nomba likoto lya bantu lyalamukonkela, kopeloko walasengula balwashi bangi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bafalisi nabambi balesa kuli Yesu pakuyanda kumutapa mukanwa pakumwipusheti, “Sena casuminishiwa mu Mulawo, muntu kuleka mukashendi pa cebo ciliconse?” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Sena nkamuna mubelengapo kwambeti kumatatikilo, Mulengi walabalenga mutuloba ne mutukashi?” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Neco walambeti, “Ecebo cakendi mutuloba nakashiye baishi ne banyina, ne kuya kupamankana ne mukashendi, neco bantu babili aba nibakabeti mubili umo?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neco nkabacilipo babili sobwe, nsombi mubili umo, palico Lesa ncalapamankanya pamo kapataba muntu shikupansanya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Basa Bafalisi balamwipusheti, “Inga Mose walambila cani kwambeti mutuloba welela kupa mukashendi cipepala cakumuleka?” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Mose walamusuminisha kuleka ba makashenu, pakwinga kumwiyisha amwe cayuma, nsombi kumatatikilo a cindi, nkacali kubeco sobwe” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lino ndamwambilishingeti, “Uliyense lalekenga mukashendi pacebo ciliconse, cabula kuba mulandu wabupombo, ne kuya kweba naumbi, ukute mulandu wabupombo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi balamwambileti, “Anu nacilico pakati pa mulume ne mukashendi, cilicena kwikala bunkonta.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabambileti, “Ciyisho ici nkacelela kutambulwa cena ne bantu bonse sobwe, nsombi abo bonka balapewa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pali bintu bingi bikute kupa bantu kuteba batukashi, nabambi encobalasemwa, nabambi nicebo cakulakilwa kakowa pamukombo, pali nabambi balasala bene bonka kuteba kwambeti basebensele cena Lesa. Uyo welela kucikonsha kukonkela ciyisho ici, akonkele.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalelekenga batwanike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliko 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nabambi bantu balaleta bana babo kuli Yesu kwambeti abike makasa akendi palyendibo, ne kubapailila, nomba beshikwiya bakendi balabakalalila. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walambeti, “Balekeni bana bese kuli njame, kamutabakanishanga sobwe, pakwinga Bwami bwakwilu ni bwa bantu bali mbuli aba.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Popelapo walabika makasa palyendibo, panyuma pakendi walafumapo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mutuloba wabubile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliko 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mutuloba naumbi walesa kuli Yesu ne kumwipusheti, “Bashikwiyisha, ni cipeyo cintu caina ncondelela kwinsa kwambeti nkacane buyumi butapu?” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Inga ulanjipushilinga cani sha cintu caina pakwinga pali umowa Waina? Na usuni kucana buyumi butapu, konkela Milawo.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nendi walepusheti, “Milawo cini?” Yesu walakumbuleti, “Kotashina, kotapombola, kotaiba, kotapa bukamboni bwabwepeshi, <verse number="19" style="v"/>lemekesha baiso ne banyoko, kayi suna munobe mbuli ncolisuni omwine.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Usa muntu walambeti, “Milawo yonseyi ndalatatika kwikonkela kufuma kaindi, inga ncondicili ndabulilwa nicani kayi?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Na ulayandanga kuba muntu walulama, koya ulishe bintu byonse mbyokute. Mali ngoshucanemo uyabile bapenshi, buboni bwakobe nukabucane kwilu, wapwisha kwinseco, wise unkonke.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Usa muntu mpwalanyumfwa maswi awo walafumapo kali wongumana mumoyo, pakwinga walikuba mubile cikamba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu walambila beshikwiya bakendi, “Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, nicapatali ku muntu mubile kwingila mu Bwami bwakwilu.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kayi ndambangeti, “Nicapafupi munyama munene ukute kukwiweti ngamila kupita mukamulyango ka nyeleti, kupita muntu mubile kwingila mu Bwami bwa Lesa.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Beshikwiya mpobalanyumfweco, balakankamana ne kwambeti, “Anu na cilico, nomba niyani wela kupuluka?” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu walabalangishisha walambeti, “Ibi nkabikonsheke ne bantu sobwe, nsombi bintu byonse bikute kukonsheka ne Lesa.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Popelapo Petulo walakumbulapo, “Afwe twalashiya bintu byonse ne kumukonkela, nomba afwe lino ni tukatambulepo cani?” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, Lesa akabibambulula cena bintu byonse, Mwana Muntu nakekale pa Cipuna cakendi ca Bulemeneno ca Bwami, ne njamwe omulankonkelenga ni mukekale pa bipuna likumi ne bibili bya Bwami, kamombolosha mikowa likumi ne ibili ya Baislayeli. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Neco uliyense walashiya ng'anda, bakwabo batuloba, nambi nkashi, nambi baishi, nambi banyina, nambi banabendi, nambi mabala pacebo cakame, uyo nendi nakatambule bingi byapita tunkanda mwanda, panyuma pakendi kayi nakapewe buyumi butapu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nomba abo pa cino cindi bali kuntangu nibakabe kunyuma, kayi abo bali kunyuma pacino cindi, nibakabe kuntangu.”</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Basebenshi balembwa ncito pacindi capusana pusana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Bwami bwa kwilu ngatubukoshanisha cisa. Muntu walanyamuka mumene mene kuya kulemba beshikusebensa mulibala lyakendi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Balasuminishana kubafolesha lyali limo lya silifa lyelela kufoleshewa pa busuba, nekubatuma kulibala lyakendi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Cindi ca muma 9 koloko walacana nabambi kabali bekala pamusena wa makwebo babula ncito. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Naboyo walabambileti, “Ne njamwe kamuyani kulibala lyakame lya maila, nindimufoleshe mwakwelana.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Naboyo balaya. Cindi ca munshi, kayi ne cindi camuma 3 koloko mansailo. Muntu usa walalemba basebenshi nabambi ne kubatuma kulibala lyakendi lya maila. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kayi camuma 5 koloko mansailo, walacana bantu nabambi kabali bekala. Walabepusheti, “Mwekalilacani lisuba lyonse kwakubula ncito?” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Balo balamukumbuleti, “Paliya muntu latwingishiko ncito sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">Naboyo walabambileti, “Ne njamwe kamuyani ku libala lyakame.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mansailo lisuba kaliya kwibila, mwine libala walambila Kapitawo wakendi, “Bakuwe basebenshi bonse, ubafoleshe. Utatikile abo balengili ncito mu ma 5 koloko, basa batanguna kwingila ncito beti bashalilile.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mpobalesa basa balengila ncito cindi ca 5 koloko mansailo uliyense walafola lyali limo lya silifa, lyelela kufeleshewa pa ncito ya busuba bumo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lino mpobalesa basa balatanguna, balo balayeyeti nibafole mali angi, nomba uliyense walafola lyali limo lyelela kufoleshewa pa ncito ya busuba bumo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nomba nabo pakufola balatatika kutongaukila mwine libala, <verse number="12" style="v"/>balambeti, “Ha! Banetu balengili ncito lino lino, balasebensowa kwa ola limo, cilyeconi mulabafoleshe kwelana ne njafwe, kakuli afwe tulafu misana ne ncito, lumwi lulatupwili pamubili!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nomba nendi mwine libala walamukumbuleti, “Obe ndo, ndiya kukwibilapo sobwe, sena ntetwalasuminishana lyali limo lya silifa pa busuba? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Manta lyali lyakobe, koya. Njame ndemwine ndayeye kwambeti mfoleshe beshikushalila mwakwelanika nenjobe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Sena nkandasunguluka mwangofu pabintu byakame kwinsa mbuli mondayandilinga? Sena ulepilwa pakwinga ndaina moyo pakutasalulula pakufolesha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Neco Yesu pakupwililisha walambeti, “Bakunyuma nibakabe kuntangu, kayi bakuntangu nibakabe kunyuma.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kayi Yesu lambanga sha lufu lwakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maliko 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pacindi Yesu mpwalikuya ku Yelusalemu, walabatwala palubasu beshikwiya bakendi likumi ne babili, ne kubambileti, <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Ee, tuli pabulwendo bwakuya ku Yelusalemu, nomba kopeloko Mwa Muntu nakatwalwe kuba makulene beshimilumbo, ne beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose. Nibakamomboloshe ne kusuminishaneti afwe, <verse number="19" style="v"/>kayi nibakamutwale kubantu bamishobo naimbi, beti bakamunyanshe, ne kumukwapula, ne kumupopa palusanda. Nomba pabusuba bwatutatu nendi nakapundushiwe kubafu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kusenga kwa muka Sebedayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maliko 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Muka Sebedayo ne bana bendi babili balesa kuli Yesu, walasuntama ne kumusengeti abenshileko kantu kalikonse nketi basenge. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu walamwipusheti, “Mulayandanga cani mama?” Uyu mutukashi walambeti, “Kamunshomeshesha kwambeti, banabame aba, umo akekale kucikasa cenu cakululyo, naumbi kucikasa cakucipiko mu Bwami bwenu.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nomba nendi Yesu walakumbuleti, “Nkamucinshi ncomulasengenga, Sena ngamucikonsha kunwina pamo mu nkomeshi yamapensho njoti nwinemo?” Bonse balambeti, “Ee, ngatucikonsha.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Ee, nimukanwe munkomeshiyo, nomba ame ndiya ngofu shakusala uyo eti akekale kucikasa cakame cakululyo, nambi kucikasa cakucipiko, Bata endibo beti bakape misena ilico kubantu abo mbobabambila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mpobalanyumfwako bali likumi basa, balakalalila basa babili pabukwabo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu walabakuwa beshikwiya bakendi bonse ne kubambileti, “Mucinsheti bendeleshi ba bantu ba mishobo naimbi bakute kulyela masuku pamitwi ya bantu babo, ne kubonesha ngofu shabo pabantu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nomba nkacelela kubeco pakati penu sobwe, pali njamwe uliyense layandanga kuba mukulene, abe musebenshi wenu.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Kayi uliyense layandanga kuba mutangunishi pakati penu, abe musha wenu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kamubani mbuli Mwana Muntu utasuni kusebenselwa, nsombi kusebensela bantu, ne kubenga buyumi bwakendi kulubula bantu bangi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga bantu babili bashipilwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliko 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi mpobalikufuma mu munshi wa Yeliko, bantu bangi balikumukonkela. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bantu babili bashipilwa balikuba bekala mumbali mwa nshila balanyumfweti Yesu lapitinga munshila, balatatika kubilikisha, “Nkambo omwanendi Dafeti, kamutunyumfwilako nkumbo.” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Basa bantu balayanda kubamweneka mwakubacancilila, nsombi balo empobalapitilisha kolobesha, “Nkambo omwanendi Dafeti, kamutunyumfwilako nkumbo.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu walemana, walabakuwa, ne kubepusheti, “Inga mulayandanga ndimwinshile cani?” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Balo balakumbuleti, “Nkambo tulayandanga tutatike kubona.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu walabanyumfwila luse, walabekata pamenso, popelapo balatatika kubona, naboyo balamukonkela.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lengilinga mu Yelusalemu bwabulemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohane 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mpobalashika pepi ku Yelusalemu, balashika nanshi ku Betifage ku mulundu wa maolifi, Yesu walatuma beshikwiya bakendi babili, <verse number="2" style="v"/>ne kubambileti, “Kamuyani mu munshi uwu ngomulabononga pantangu apa, mwaya mwengila, nimucane mbongolo wasungililwa pamo ne mwanendi, mu basungulule mubalete kuno.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na muntu amwipushe, mumwambileti, “Mwami labayandanga, apwisha kubasebensesha nabalete.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Ici calenshika kwambeti maswi alamba mushinshimi akwanilishiwe, akwambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Kamwambilani munshi wa Siyoni kwambeti</para>
  <para style="q">Kobona Mwami wakobe lesanga kulinjobe,</para>
  <para style="q">Walicepesha, kayi watanta pa mbongolo.</para>
  <para style="q">Watanta pa mwana mbongolo,</para>
  <para style="q">nyama ishikumanta mitolo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Popelapo beshikwiya balensa mbuli Yesu ncalabambila. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Balaleta mbongolo pamo ne mwanendi, balayansa bikwisa pamusana pa mwanambongolo, uyo ngwalatantapo Yesu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bantu bangi balayansa bikwisa munshila, nabambi balakwakula misampi yabitondo ne kwiyansa munshila. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bantu bangi balikuba pantangu ne balikuba panyuma, balatatika kubilikisheti, “Hosana kuli Mwanendi Dafeti. Walelekwa uyo lesanga mu Lina lya Lesa, Hosana kuli Lesa wakwilu ku Mayoba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalengila mu Yelusalemu, bantu bonse balakankamana, nabambi balikabepusheti, “Anu uyu niyani?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bantu bangi balakumbuleti, “Uyu emushinshimi, Yesu waku Nasaleti, mucishi ca Galileya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu laswepeshenga Ng'anda ya Lesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohane 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu walengila mu Ng'anda ya Lesa,ne kutandanyamo bantu bonse balikulisha ne kula. Walawishila panshi matebulu ngobalikulishilapo beshikushintanisha mali, ne bipuna bya beshikulisha nkulimba, <verse number="13" style="v"/>Walabambileti, “Mabala alambangeti, ‘Ng'anda yakame nikabe yakupaililamo,’ Nomba amwe mulaisandulu kuba mwakuyubila bakabwalala.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Popelapo balema ne bashipilwa balesa kuli Yesu mu Ng'anda ya Lesa mopelemo, nendi walabasengula. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bamakulene beshimilumbo ne beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose, mpobalabona byeshikukondwelesha mbyalensa kayi ne kunyumfwa batwanike mu ng'anda ya Lesa kababilikisheti, “Hosana kuli Mwanendi Dafeti,” Calabepila mu moyo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Neco, Yesu balamwipusheti, “Sena mulanyumfunga mbyobalambanga batwanike aba?” Nendi Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Ee, kanshi nkamuna mubelengapo Maswi alambangeti Lesa walabambilalimo batwanike ne bakateta kwambeti nibakamutembaule kwakupwililila?” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Popelapo Yesu walabashiya, ne kuya ku Betani nkwalakona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lashingananga citondo ca Mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maliko 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mpobwalaca mumene mene, Yesu mpwalikubwelela ku Yelusalemu walanyumfwa nsala. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mpwalabona citondo ca mukuyu pepi ne nshila, walayapo, nomba walacana kacikutowa matewu. Popelapo walacambila citondo camukuyu, “citondobe, kufuma lelo nteti ukasemepo bisepo sobwe.” Cindi copeleco citondo camukuyu cisa calayuma nta. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Beshikwiya mpobalaboneco balakankamana balamwipusha Yesu, “Inga citondo ca mukuyu ici cilafwambaneconi kuyuma?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti na lushomo lwenu ntelo lwakutonshanya nimukacikonshenga kwinsa mbuli ncondenshili citondo ca mukuyu ici. Nteconkeco sobwe, nsombi na muwambila mulundu uwu, kwambeti, ‘Fuma apa, koya uliwale mu lwenje, mpaka nicikenshike.’ <verse number="22" style="v"/>Na mupaila ne lushomo ciliconse nceti mukasenge nimukapewe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Balamwipushunga Yesu pa makani a ngofu shakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliko 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Cindi Yesu ncalengila mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, ne kutatika kwiyisha, bamakulene beshimilumbo, ne bamakulene Baciyuda, balesa kumwipusheti, “Mwalashifunya kupeyo ngofu shakwinsa cisa? Niyani walamupa ngofu ishi?” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabakumbuleti, “ne njame nindimwipushe mwipusho umo, mwankumbula, bacu, nindimwambile nkondalafunya ngofu shakwinsa cisa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwambeti Yohane abatishenga, ngofu walashifunya kupeyo, kuli Lesa nambi kubantu?” Balo balatatika kutotekeshana pa lwabo bene, “Natukumbuleti walashifunya kuli Lesa, nendi nambeti, inga mwalabulila cani kumushoma? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nomba kayi natukumbuleti walashifunya kubantu, bantu nteti batulekepo sobwe, pakwinga balambangeti, Yohane nimushinshimi.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Neco balamukumbuleti, “Afwe nkatucishipo sobwe.” Nendi walambeti, “Anu ne njame nteti ndimwambilepo sobwe nkondalashicana ngofu shakwinsa cisa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa bana batuloba babili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Amwe ngamuyeyapo aconi? Muntu naumbi walikukute bana batuloba babili. Walaya kumwanendi mukulene ne kumwambileti, ‘Mwaname, koya lelo usebense kumabala.’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Walakumbuleti ‘Sobwe nkasuni,’ Nsombi panyuma pakendi walalitibuka, walaya ku mabala kuya kusebensa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Baishi balaya kumwanabo kanike ne kumwambila maswi amo amo ngobalambila mwanabo mukulene. Nendi walambeti, ‘Ndanyumfu ta, ndenga kusebensa.’ Nsombi uliya kuyako. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pa bana babili aba walensa ncobalikuyanda baishi nupeyo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Balo balambeti, “wakutanguna usa.” Yesu walabambileti, “Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, beshikusonkesha misonko ne batukashi bapombo balengilinga mu Bwami bwa Lesa, amwe kamutana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yohane Mubatishi walesa kumulesha nshila yabululami, amwe muliya kushoma sobwe, kakuli beshikusonkesha misonko, ne batukashi bapombo balo balamushoma, Amwe nambi mwalabibona, muliya kulitibuka kwambeti mumushome.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wabasebenshi balikulima libala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliko 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Kamunyumfwani mukoshanyo naumbi, Muntu naumbi walikukute libala. Mulibalo'mo walabyalamo minyansa, walebaka luba kushinguluka libala lyonse, walaimba cisengu mwakutyanina minyansa, walaibaka lupingwe lwa kupembelelapo libala. Panyuma pakendi walalibwelekesha libala lisa ku balimi, nendi walaya bulwendo kucishi cimbi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Cindi cakutebula mpocalashika, muntu usa walatuma basebenshi bakendi ku balimi basa, kwambeti bamupeko bisepo bya mulibala lisa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nomba balimi basa balabekata basebenshi basa, umo balamuma, naumbi balamushina, naumbi balamupwaya mabwe. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Muntu usa walatumako basebenshi nabambi bangi kupita basa bakutanguna. Kayi balimi basa balabensa cimo cimo. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kumapwililisho balimi basa walabatumina Mwanendi, ne kwambeti, ‘Mwaname uyu enka nibenga bamupe bulemu.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nomba balimi basa mpobalamubona Mwanendi usa, balatatika kumufwiya, kabambeti, ‘uyu eshakapyane buboni bonse. Tiyeni tumushine kwambeti buboni ubu bukabe bwetu.’ <verse number="39" style="v"/>Neco balamwikata, nekumuwala kunsa kwa libala ne kumushina.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Inga mwine libala lisa lya minyansa akesa nakabenseconi balimi basa?” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Balo balakumbuleti, “Nakabashine balimi baipa basa, ne kulibwelekesha libala lisa kubalimi nabambi belela kumupako bisepo pacindi cakendi celela.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu walabepusheti, “Sena muliya kubelengapo Mabala alambangeti, ‘Libwe lyacandanshi ndyobalakana beshikwibaka,’ Elilaba libwe lya nkokola ya ng'anda lilayandikinga? Lesa mwine ewalacinseci, kayi cilatukankamanishi kucibona.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Encondamwambililingeti, “Bwami bwa Lesa, nibukalamunwe kulinjamwe ne kubupa bantu bambi abo belela kusema bisepo.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Uliyense eshakawile palibwe ili, nakapasauke pasauke. Uyo ngoshi likamuwile, nendi nakashanyaukilelimo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Bamakulene beshimilumbo, ne Bafalisi mpobalanyumfwa mikoshanyo njalikwamba Yesu, balenshibeti wambangendibo. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Neco balayanda kumwikata nsombi balatina bantu, pakwinga bantu bangi balikuba bashometi, Yesu nimushinshimi.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa malyalya a bwinga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu walamba kayi mumikoshanyo ingi. Walambeti, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Bwami bwakwilu bwakoshaneti, Mwami walabambila mwanendi malyalya a bwinga.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Walatuma basebenshi bakendi kuya kutamba bantu ku malyalya abwinga kwambeti bese, nsombi nabo balakana. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Walatuma kayi nabambi, ne kubambileti, “Yani mwambile bonse basa balatambwa, kwambeti cakulya cilabambwa, ndashini ng'ombe, ne bombe bansuka, byonse bilabambwa, kamwisani ku malyalya abwinga.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nomba abo balatambwa baliya kuyako sobwe, bonse balaya kuncito shabo. Naumbi walaya kumabala kwakendi, naumbi walaya kumakwebo akendi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nabambi balekata basebenshi basa, balabapensha ne kubashina.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwami walakalala kwine, walatuma bashilikali bakendi kuya kubashina basa bantu balikushina banabo, ne kubatentela munshi wabo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi walakuwa basebenshi bakendi ne kubambileti, malyalya abwinga alabambwa, nomba balatambwa basa nkabanga belela. <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Anu lino kamuyani mu mampambanya a nshila, mwenga mutambe balibonse mbweshi mucane, bese kumalyalya abwinga kuno.” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Cakubinga basebenshi basa balaya munshila kuya kutamba balibonse mbobalikucana, baipa ne baina, ng'anda yalesula ne bantu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mwami mpwalengila mung'andomo kuya kubona bantu balatambwa, walabonamo muntu naumbi wabula kufwala cakufwala capabwinga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Walamwipusheti, “Obe ndo, ulengili aconi muno wabula cakufwala capabwinga?” Nendi walabula cakukumbula. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mwami walambila basebenshi bakendi, “Musungeni kumyendo ne kumakasa, mu muwale kunsa mu mushinshe. Kopeloko nkweshi akalilenga ne kukokota meno.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pakupwililisha Yesu walambeti, “Ee, batambwa nibangi, nsombi, balasalwa nibang'ana.”</para>
  <para style="s">Makani akusonka musonko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliko 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pacindi nacimbi, Bafalisi balapangana sha kumutapa mukanwa Yesu pakumwipusha mipusho. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Balatuma beshikwiya babo nabambi, ne bamucipani candale ca Helode kuya kuli Yesu, balambeti, “Bashikwiyisha, tucishi kwambeti mukute kwamba cakubinga, mukute kwiyisha nshila ya Lesa mwakubinga, kayi nkamukute kutinapo muntu sobwe, nkamukute kuboneti uyu niyani.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Neco tulesa kwambeti mutwambileko ncomulayeyenga. “Sena Milawo ya Lesa yasuminisha kusonka musonko kuli Mwami waku Loma, nambi sobwe?” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu pakwishiba miyeyo yabo yaipa, nendi walabepusheti, “Inga mulanjelekeshelenga cani, amwe bantu bandemi shibili? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kamumboneshako lyali lyamusonko, nabo balamutambika lyali.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Popelapo walabepusheti, “Inga cinso ne lina ili lyalembwapa nilyabani?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Balo balamukumbuleti, “byonse bilipo nibya Mwami waku Loma.” Neco nendi Yesu walabambileti, “Anu mupeni Mwami waku Loma bintu byakendi, Mupeni Lesa bintu byakendi.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bantu abo mpolabanyumfweco balapwilwa mano, balafumapo ne kumushiya.</para>
  <para style="s">Makani akupunduka kubafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliko 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pa busuba bopelobo nabambi Basaduki abo bakute kushometi bafwa nteti bakapunduke, balesa kuli Yesu, ne kumwipusheti, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Bashikwiyisha, Mose walambeti, ‘Na mutuloba ufwa kwakubula kusemapo bana, mukwabo welela kumupyana mukalubingi ne kusemenamo bana beti bakabengeti banabendi usa mukwabo walafwa.’ <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lino kucomwetu kwalikuba bantu basanu ne babili pabukwabo. Wakutanguna waleba mukashi, walafwa wabulapo mwana, mukashi usa walapyanwa ne mukwabo. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Calenshika cimo cimo kuli wacibili walamupyana, kayi wacitatu walamupyana, mpaka kuli wacisanu ne cibili. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pamapwililisho pakendi nendi mutukashi usa walafwa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Neco twambile inga lino pabusuba bwakupunduka bantu kubafu, mutukashi uyu, nakabe mukashi wabani, kakuli batuloba bonse basanu ne babili pabukwabo balamwebapo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Mwalubila, pakwinga nkamwayishi Mabala nambi ngofu sha Lesa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pakwinga bantu beti bakapunduke kubafu, nteti bakebenga nambi kwebwa sobwe, bonse nibakabengeti bangelo bakwilu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nomba cakwambeti bantu nibakapunduke kubafu, sena muliya kubelengapo Lesa ncalamwambila amwe, mpwalambeti, <verse number="32" style="v"/>‘Ame njame Lesa wa Abulahamu, Lesa wa Isake, Lesa wa Yakobo.’ Anu uko ekwambeti, ni Lesa wa bantu bayumi, nteshi wa bantu bafwa sobwe.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bantu bangi balikubapo mpobalanyumfweco balakankamana ne kwiyisha kwakendi.</para>
  <para style="s">Mulawo unene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maliko 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Bafalisi,mpobalanyumfweti Yesu, labatoteke Basaduki, balabungana pamo. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Umo nkalakata shikwiyisha milawo ya Mose, walelekesha kayi kumutapa Yesu mukanwa pakumwipusheti, <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Bashikwiyisha, pa Milawo yonse ya Lesa, unenepo nupeyo?” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Suna Mwami Lesa wakobe ne moyo wakobe wonse, ne buyumi bwakobe bonse, ne mano akobe onse.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Uwu emulawo unene kayi emulawo wakutanguna. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mulawo watubili niwa kwambeti, “Kosuna munobe mbuli ncolisuni omwine. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Milawo yonse ya Mose, ne biyisho byonse mbyobalikwiyisha bashinshimi byona pa Milawo ibili iyi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Makani a Mupulushi Walaiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mpobalabungana pamo Bafalisi, Yesu walabepusha mwipusho. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Walambeti, “mulayeyenga cani sha Mupulushi Walaiwa? Mulayeyengeti ni Mwana wabani?” Balo balambeti, “Ni mwanendi Dafeti,” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu walabepusheti, “Inga ni pacebo cini Dafeti mwine pakutanguninwa ne Mushimu Uswepa, walamukuwa Mupulushi Walaiwa useti, Mwami wakendi? Walambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Mwami Lesa, walambila Mwami wakameti,</para>
  <para style="q">Ikala kucikasa cakame cakululyo,</para>
  <para style="q">mpaka nkabike balwani bakobe,</para>
  <para style="q">kuba cakulyatapo myendo yakobe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>“Na Dafeti mwine walamukuwa Mupulushi Walaiwa eti, ‘Lesa wakame,’ Inga ngobeconi mwanendi?” <verse number="46" style="v"/>Paliya nabaumo walelekesha kukumbulapo maswi. Kufuma busuba ubo, paliya muntu walaliyuminishako moyo kwambeti, amwipusheko naba mwipusho umo.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lakansanga Bafalisi ne beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maliko 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luka 11:43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi, Yesu walamba ku likoto lyabantu bangi, kayi ne kuli beshikwiya bakendi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Walabambileti, “Beshikwiyisha Milawo ya Mose ne Bafalisi bakute ncito ya kusansulula Milawo ya Mose.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi mwelela kukonka byonse mbyobala mwiyishinga. kamutensanga mbyobalenshinga, pakwinga nkabakute kwinsa mbyobakute kwiyisha sobwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Balo bakute kunyamwisha bantu mitolo yalema, njobatakumyuko ne kambombo kabo kunyamfwilisha kumanta mitolo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bakute kwinsa bintu byonse kwambeti bantu bababone. Bakute kusungilila tukwisa tunene pankumo ne pamakasa twalembwapo maswi a Lesa! Bonani kutalimpisha mayombo kuminganjo yabo! <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kayi bakute kuyanda kwikala pa bipuna byabulemu pa misena yalemekeshewa ya malyalya, ne mu manda akupaililamo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bakute kuyandeti bantu babapenga mitende yabulemu mu misena ya makwebo, ne kubakuweti, bashikwiyisha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba amwe bantu kabata mukuwangeti, bashikwiyisha sobwe, pakwinga mukute shikwiyisha umowa, mwense ni pabukwenu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kamutakuwanga muntu naba umo panshi pano eti, Ta, pakwinga amwe mukute ba Meshenu bamowa, Ba meshenu bakwilu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nabo bantu kabata mukuwangeti, batangunishi sobwe, pakwinga mutangunishi wenu ni Klistu umowa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pakati penu mukulene abe musebenshi wenu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ee, uyo lalisumpulunga mwine, nakacepeshewe, uyo lalicepeshenga nakasumpulwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lakalalilinga beshikwiyisha Milawo ya Mose ne Bafalisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maliko 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Malele kulinjamwe beshikwiyisha Milawo ya Mose, ne njamwe Bafalisi, bantu bandemi shibili! Mulacalanga cishinga pa menso abantu caku Bwami bwakwilu.Pakwinga mucinsheti nteti mukenglemo, neco mulashinkilishinga bantu balayandanga kwingilamo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">Malele kulinjamwe beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose nenjamwe Bafalisi, bantu ba ndemi shibili mukute kubebila bamukalubingi kubalyela buboni bwani bwabo pakubanyengelelela ne mipailo yenu itali itali.</note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Malele kulinjamwe beshikwiyisha Milawo ya Mose, ne njamwe Bafalisi, bantu bandemishibili! Mukute kubebila bamukalubingi, kubalyela buboni bwabo, pakubanyengelela ne mipailo yenu itali itali. Pacebo ico Lesa nakamomboloshe mwangofu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Malele kulinjamwe beshikwiyisha Milawo ya Mose, ne njamwe Bafalisi, bantu bandemishibili! Mukute kwenda nyendo shingi pa lwenje ne pamutunta, kulangaula muntu umo kwambeti mu musandule abe shikwiya wenu. Nomba kayi mwa mucana, mukute kumusandula tunkanda tubili kuba welela Gehena, kupita amwe mobene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Malele kulinjamwe, batangunishi bashipilwa! Amwe mukute kwiyisheti, muntu alumbileti, pa Ng'anda ya Lesa, ciliya mulandu, nsombi na ulumbileti, pamali ali mu ng'anda ya Lesa, uyo welela kusunga kulumbila kwakendi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Amwe bantu bapusa, kayi bashipilwa! Cinene nicipeyo, mali nambi Ng'anda ya Lesa iyo ikute kusandula mali kuba aswepa? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kayi mukute kwambeti, Muntu alumbileti, panteme ya milumbo, ciliya mulandu, Nsombi na ulumbileti, pa cishikubengwa panteme, uyo welela kusunga kulumbila kwakendi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Amwe bantu bashipilwa! Cinene nicipeyo, cisa cishikubengwa nambi nteme ya milumbo iyo ikute kusandula cishikubengwa kuba caswepa? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Neco, muntu alumbileti, panteme ya milumbo, ekwambeti lalumbilili kumo ne byonse bili panteme. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Alumbileti, pa Ng'anda ya Lesa, ekwambeti lalumbilili kumo ne Ng'andeyo pamo ne Lesa ukute kwikalamo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kayi Alumbileti, mbuli kwilu, lalumbili pa Cipuna ca Bwami bwa Lesa, kubikapo ne uyo wekala pa Cipuna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Malele kulinjamwe beshikwiyisha Milawo ya Mose, ne njamwe Bafalisi, bantu bandemi shibili! Mukute kubenga ca likumi ca tumbuto twanunkila, twakubika mucakulya, nsombi mukute kusula Milawo ya Lesa yancine ncine, mbuli kombolosha kwalulama ne nkumbo kayi ne kushomeka. Mwanga mwelela kwinseco, kutashiyapo nabimbi sobwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Amwe batangunishi bashipilwa, mukute kufunya shikanshi lawili momulanunga, nsombi mukute kumina munyama munene ukute kukwiweti ngamila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Malele amwe beshikwiyisha Milawo ya Mose, ne njamwe Bafalisi, bantu bandemi shibili! Mukute kusuka kunsa kwa nkomeshi ne mbale, kakuli mukati mwesula bukuma ne kuliyanda. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Amwe Ba falisi bashipilwa, tangunani nanshi kusuka mukati munkomeshi ne mbale, mpweshi musuke kunsa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Malele kulinjamwe beshikwiyisha Milawo ya Mose, ne njamwe Bafalisi, bantu bandemi shibili! Mulyeti manda ashibululwa ne laimu akute kuboneka cena kunsa, kakuli mukati mwesula mafupa abantu bafwa ne bintu bingi byabola. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ne njamwe ncomubele pamenso abantu mukute kuboneketi mwalulama, kakuli mukati mwenu mwesula bundenga mano ne bintu byaipa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Malele kuli njamwe beshikwiyisha Milawo ya Mose, ne njamwe Bafalisi, bantu bandemi shibili! Mukute kubamba cena manda abashinshimi bakulu kulu, ne kushibulula bibumbwanya bya bantu balulama. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mukute kwambeti, ne twalikubako pacindi ncobalikubako bamashali betu bakulu kulu, nshinga ne twalabula kumantako lubasu pakushina basa bashinshimi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nomba mulalisungunga mobene, pakwinga mulasuminingeti, mobashikulu ba bantu abo balashina bashinshimi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ee, lino kamupwishani ncito njobalatatika bamashali benu bakulukulu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambilinga limo sha lombolosho lwabo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Mwenjoka amwe, bana bampili, ni mukayubeconi lombolosho lwa Gehena? <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lino kamunyumfwani! Ni nkamutumine bashinshimi, ne bantu bamano, ne beshikwiyisha. Nabambi ni mukabashine ne kubapopa pa nsanda, nabambi ni mukabakwapule bikoti mu manda enu akupaililamo, kayi ni mukabapenshe ne kubatandanya kufuma pamunshi umo ne umo. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Neco nimukacanike ne mulandu wabantu bonse balulama balashinwa pacishi capanshi, kufumina pakushinwa kwa Abele, muntu walulama, mpaka pa kushinwa kwa Sakaliya mwanendi Balakiya, uyo ngomwalashinina mu Ng'anda ya Lesa pakati pa nteme ya milumbo, ne Musena wa Swepeshesha. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndamwambilingeti, lombolosho lulico nebintu byonse nibikenshike mu musemano uwu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalililinga Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ha! Obe Yelusalemu, Yelusalemu! Weshikushina bashinshimi, ne kupwaya mabwe bantu Lesa mbwalakutumininga. Ndayandanga kufukatila pamo banabobe tunkanda tungaye, mbuli nkuku ncekute kufukatila twana twayo mu mapepe akendi, nsombi obe ulakana! <verse number="38" style="v"/>Cakubinga kamubonani nomba, ng'anda yenu ineneyi nibe matongo. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kayi ndamwambilishingeti,kufuma cindi cino nteti mukambonepo sobwe, mpaka cindi ncoti mukambeti, “Walelekwa uyo lesanga mu Lina lya enka bulyo walibela.”</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambanga sha kumwayiwa kwa Ng'anda ya Lesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maliko 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu walapula mu Ng'anda ya Lesa,lino mpwalikuya beshikwiya bakendi balamulesha ncoyalebakwa mwabuya Ng'anda iyo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walabambileti, “Ee mulabono ibi byonse, nomba cakubinga ndamwambilingeti, paliya libwe lyeti likashale palibwe linendi,lyeti likabule kupwayaulwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Makatasho ne mapensho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maliko 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino Yesu mpwalekala panshi pa mulundu wa maolifi, beshikwiya bakendi balesa kulyendiye palubasu bonka ne kumwipusheti, “Kamutwambilako, inga ibi nibikenshike lilyoni? Kayi nicani ceshi cikenshikenga nceti tukaboneneko kwisa kwenu, kayi ne cakupwa kwacindici?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Cenjelani, kamutakabepwa ne muntu uliyense sobwe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bantu bangi nibakese mulina lyakame! Kabambeti, ‘Klistu usa njame,’ Nibakabepe bantu bangi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nimukanyumfwe nkondo, kayi ne mbili shiyosha nkondo. Nomba amwe kamutaka yakamwa, Ee, ibi byela kwinshika, nsombi uku nteko kwambeti mapwililisho nawo alashiki kendi sobwe.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Pakwinga mishobo ya bantu nikabukilane, nabo bwami nibikalwanenga ne bwami. Nikukabe nsala, ne bikunkumo bishikutenkanya inshi mu misena ingi, <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba ibi byonse nicitatikowa ca mapensho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Bantu nibakamusunge ne kumupensha kayi ne kumushina. Bantu bamishobo yonse nibakamupele pacebo ca Lina lyakame. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Bantu bangi pacindico nibakaleke kushoma, nibakatatike kupelana ne kulishana pamukowa wabo bene. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nikukaboneke bashinshimi bandemishibili beti bakabepe bantu bangi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pacebo cakufula kwabintu byaipa, lusuno lwabantu bangi nilukacepe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nsombi uyo eshakalimbikile mpaka kumapwililisho, endiyeti akapuluke. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nomba Mulumbe Waina uwu wa Bwami bwa Lesa nukakambaukwe pacishi capanshi conse, kwambeti, ube bukamboni kubantu ba mishobo yonse, popelapo mapwililisho nakashike.”</para>
  <para style="s">Cintu cishikusesemya kayi cishikononga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maliko 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Mwakabona cintu cishikusesemya cishikononga, calambwa ne Danyele mushinshimi, balacimaniki pa musena waswepa.” Obe ulabelengenga unyumfwishishe cena. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Abo bali mu Yudeya bela kufwambila kumilundu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Uyo uli pelu pa ng'anda yakendi kataseluka kuya kwingila mu ng'anda eti amantemo bibya byakendi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Uyo uli kumabala, kataya kumunshi kuya kumanta cakufwala cakunsa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Malele ku batukashi beti bakabenga ne mabunda, kayi ne batukashi beti bakayamwishenga bana mumasubayo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pailani kwambeti cindi cakufwamba kacitakaba cindi camupewo, nambi pa busuba bwa Sabata sobwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pakwinga mapensho ayosha eti akaboneke mu masubayo, nkanabonekapo kufuma mpocalalengelwa cishi capanshi mpaka lelo, kayi nteti akabonekepo sobwe. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nomba masubayo nalabula kufumfwipishiwa, nshinga ne palakabulu muntu nabaumo shikupuluka. Nsombi Lesa nakafumfwipishiwe masubayo pacebo cabantu mbwalasala.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Cindico na muntu akamwambileti, ‘Klistu ulikuno!’ Nambi ‘uli uko!’ Kamutakamushoma sobwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pakwinga nikukaboneke baklistu ne bashinshimi bangi bandemishibili, beti bakambengeti, Kamubonani ‘Njame Klistu,’ Nambi kwambeti ‘njame mushinshimi,’ Abo bantu nibakensenga bintu byangofu, bishikukankamanisha, kwambeti babepe uliyense na kacikonsheka nambi basalwa ba Lesa.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kamunyumfwani, ame ndamwambilili limo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Ecebo cakendi, bantu bakamwambilangeti, ‘Kamubonani Klistu ulikucinyika,’ Kamutakayako sobwe, nambi bakambeti, ‘uli mu ng'anda,’ Kamutakashoma sobwe. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kwisa kwa Mwana Muntu nikukabeti kubyasha kwa lulabo ulo lukute kubyasha kufuma kucwe mpaka ku mbonshi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Walambeti, “kulikonse kuli mutunta wanyama yafwa, makubi nkwakute kubungana.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwisa kwa Mwana Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliko 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Panyuma pakendi mapensho akapwa mu masubayo, lisuba nilikashipe mbi, nawo mwenshi nukacileke kubala, nyenyenshi nishikalake kufuma ku makumbi, kayi ngofu sha mu mulengalenga nishikatenkane. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Popelapo citondesho cakwisa kwa Mwana Muntu, nicikaboneke kwilu. Bantu bapacishi capanshi pano, ni bakatatike kulila, nibakabone Mwana Muntu kesa mu makumbi akwilu ne ngofu ne bulemeneno buyosha. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Tolompita yangofu nikalile, popelapo nendi nakatume bangelo bakendi ku mbasu shonse shapacishi capanshi, kuya kubunganya basalwa bakendi. Kufuma kumapwililisho acishi, kushika kumapwililisho acishi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lwiyo ku citondo ca mukuyu,</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliko 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Kamulangani kucitondo ca mukuyu kwambeti mwiyeko ciyo. Mwabona misampi yakendi ne matewu atatika kusonsa, mukute kwinshibeti, mainsa alipepi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ne njamwe mwakatatika kubona bintu ibi mbyondambanga, mukenshibeti Mwana Muntu ulipepi, cakubinga uli pa cishinga. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kamwinshibani kwambeti bintu ibi nibikenshike bantu bamusemano uno kabata bapwa bonse. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kwilu ne cishi capanshi nibikapwe, nomba maswi akame nteti akapwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Paliya ubwishi busuba ne cindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Nambi kubeconi, paliya ubwishi busuba ne cindi, nambi bangelo bakwilu nkabacishipo, ne njame Ndemwana nkandicishipo sowe, nsombi Bata bonka ebaci shi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kwisa kwa Mwana Muntu nikukabeti ncokwalikuba mucindi ca Nowa. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mu masubayo, muyoba wa mfula ya cilobe kautana ushika, bantu balikulya ne kunwa, bali kweba ne kwebwa, mpaka busuba mbwalengila Nowa mubwato. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Paliya ncobalikwinshiba sobwe, mpaka muyoba wamfula yacilobe yalesa kubashina bonse. Encoti cikabe pakwisa kwa Mwana Muntu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco bantu babili nibakacanike mulibala, umo nakamantwe, naumbi nakashale. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Batukashi babili nibakacanike kabapela bunga ne mwampelo, umo nakamantwe, naumbi nakashale.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Ne njamwe kamubani mwalibambila cindi conse, pakwinga nkamubwinshipo busuba mboti akese Mwami wenu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nomba kamwishibaneti, mwine ng'anda nakute kwinshiba kwambeti nicindi cini camashiku ncalesanga kabwalala, nshinga nakute kalebe, kwambeti kabwalala katesa aibe mung'anda. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Neco, kamubani balibambila, pakwinga Mwana Muntu nakese pacindi ncomwabula kwingashila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Musebenshi washomwa, newabula kushomwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>“Inga niyani, musebenshi washomwa, kayi ukute mano? Uyo ngwalapa ncito Mwami wakendi yakwendelesha cena, ne kubapa cakulya basebenshi banendi pacindi celela? <verse number="46" style="v"/>Walelekwa musebeshuyo, na kamucane Mwami wakendi kasebensa cena. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, Mwami wakendi nakamupe ncito yakwendelesha byonse bintu mbyakute.” <verse number="48" style="v"/>“Nsombi na ni musebenshi waipa, nendi nakayeyeti, ‘Mwami wakame lacelwa cindi citali’ <verse number="49" style="v"/>Neco nakatatike kubauma basebenshi banendi, kulya ne kunwa pamo ne bacakolwa. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Pabusuba ne cindi ncabula kwingashila, Mwami wakendi nakashike sokoloku! <verse number="51" style="v"/>Neco Mwami wakendi na kamutimbaule, ne kumuwala uko kuli bantu bandemi shibili. Kopeloko eti kubenga kulila ne kukokota meno.”</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wabalindu likumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Pacindico Bwami bwakwilu nibukabeti calenshika ku balindu likumi, balamanta malampi abo ne kumucinsha shibwinga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Basanu balikuba bapusa kayi nabambi basanu balikuba bacenjela. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Basa basanu bapusa, balamanta malampi abo kwakubula kumantako mafuta apalubasu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Basa bacenjela basanu, balo balamantilila mafuta apalubasu munsupa shabo akuya kwisusha malampi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nomba shibwinga usa walacelwa, neco bonse balatatika kushinshila, balona tulo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Pakati pamashiku, kwalanyumfwika maswi abantu balikubilikisheti, ‘Shibwinga uyo lesanga! Pulani mwenga mumutambule!’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino balindu basa likumi balapunduka, ne kutatika kubamba cena malampi abo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Basa basanu bapusa, balatatika kusenga mafuta ku banabo bacenjela, ‘Kamutupako mafuta, malampi etu alashimikinga.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lino basa bacenjela balakumbuleti, ‘Bacu! Mulayandanga ne njafwe mafuta atupwile twamuyabilako, amwe kamuyani mule mafuta kuli beshikulisha.’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pacindi cindi ncobalafumapo kuya kula mafuta, nendi shibwinga walashika. Basa balindu basanu balikuba balibambila, balengila pamo mu ng'anda ya malyalya abwinga, ne cisasa calacalwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Panyuma pakendi balindu basanu bapusa basa balesa, balambeti, ‘Nkambo! Nkambo! kamutucalwilako.’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nomba shibwinga walakumbuleti, ‘Kumwambila cakubinga, nkandimwishipo sobwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu pakupwililisha walambeti, “Amwe kamubani balibambila, pakwinga nkamubwishi busuba, nambi ola lyakwisa kwakendi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa basebenshi batatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Bwami bwakwilu tubwelanike cisa, muntu naumbi walaya pabulwendo. Katananyamuka walakuwa basebenshi bakendi, ne kubashiyila ngofu shakwendelesha buboni bwakendi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Walapa uliyense mbuli ncelela kukonsha, naumbi walamupa mali amukuba myanda makumi asanu, naumbi myanda makumi abili kayi naumbi myanda likumi. Nendi walafumapo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Musebenshi usa walapewa mali myanda makumi asanu, walacaninapo kayi mali apelu akwana myanda makumi asanu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nendi usa walapewa mali myanda makumi abili, walacaninapo kayi mali apelu akwana myanda makumi abili. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nomba usa walapewa mali myanda likumi, walemba cisengu ne kwafumbika mali asa ngalapewa ne mwami wakendi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mpopalapita cindi citali, mwami usa walabwela, walabakuwa basebenshi bakendi bonse, kwambeti bamwambile mobalasebenseshela mali asa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Usa musebenshi walapewa mali myanda makumi asanu, walaletelapo kayi mali ali myanda makumi asanu, ne kwambeti “Mwami ‘pamali asa ngomwalampa ndacaninapo kayi mali akwana myanda makumi asanu.’ <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwami wakendi walamwambileti, wensa cena, njobe musebenshi waina washomeka, lino pacebo cakuba washomeka pabintu bing'ana, nindikupe lino ncito yakwendelesha bintu bingi. Kwesa usamwe pamo nenjame ndemwami wakobe. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nendi musebenshi usa walapewa mali akwana myanda makumi abili, walaletelapo mali ali myanda makumi abili ne kwambeti, mwami pamali asa ngomwalampa ndacaninapo kayi mali akwana myanda makumi abili. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mwami wakendi walamwambileti, ‘Wensa cena, njobe musebenshi waina washomeka, lino pacebo cakuba washomeka pabintu bing'ana, nindikupe ncito yakwendelesha bintu bingi. Kwesa usamwe pamo nenjame ndemwami wakobe.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Nendi musebebenshi walapewa mali myanda likumi, walambeti, ‘Nkambo ndacishibangeti mwaipa moyo, mukute kutebula nkomwabula kubyala, ne kuyobolola nkomwabula kumwaya mbuto. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Neco ndatinanga, encondalafumbikila mucisengu mali enu, nomba ntawa mali enu.’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mwami wakendi usa walamwambileti, njobe musebenshi waipa, kayi mutolo. Anu wacishibangeti, nkute kutebula nkondalabula kubyala ne kuyobolola nkondalabula kumwaya mbuto. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Neco wanga welela kuya kwibikisha ku banki kwambeti mpondesa ne ndatambulu mali ne bwili. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lino mulamuneni awo mali, mupe uyo ukute mali myanda makumi mwanda. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi uliyense ukuteko cintu, nibaka mubikilepo nabimbi, neco nakabe ne bintu bingi. Nomba uyo wabulapo cintu, nibaka mulamune nakaba kantu nkakute. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Musebenshi uyu waipa wabula ncito, muwaleni kunsa mu mushinshe, uko eti kukabenga kulila ne kukokota meno.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lombolosho lwakupwililisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Cindi Mwana Muntu akesanga kali Mwami, pamo ne bangelo bonse, nakekale pa cipuna cabwami cakendi ca Bulemeneno. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nakabunganye bantu bamishobo yonse pantangu pakendi. Nakapansanyenga bantu mbuli mwembeshi ncakute kupansanya mbelele ne mpongo. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mbelele nakashibikenga kucikasa cakendi ca kululyo, mpongo kucikasa cakendi ca kucipiko. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Neco, Mwami nakambile abo bali kucikasa cakululyo, ‘Kamwisani kuno amwe mwalelekwa ne Bata! Kamwingilani mu Bwami mbwalamubambila kufuma pakulengwa kwacishi capanshi.’ <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pakwinga ndalanyumfwa nsala mwalampa cakulya. Ndalanyumfwa nyotwa, mwalampa menshi akunwa. Ndalikuba mwensu, mwalantambula kung'anda kwenu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ndalikuba matakosha, mwalamfwalika. ndalakolwa mwalanyamfwilisha. Ndalikuba mujele, mwalesa kumbona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Popelapo balulama nibakepusheti, ‘Nkambo twalamubona kupeyo kamunyumfwa nsala, afwe ne kumupa cakulya nambi kamunyumfwa nyotwa, afwe ne kumupa menshi akunwa. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Twalamubona lilyoni kamuli bensu, afwe ne kumutambula kumanda etu, nambi kamuli matakosha, afwe ne kumufwalika? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ni lilyoni mpotwalanyumfwapo eti mulakolwanga, nambi eti muli mujele, afwe ne kwisa kumubona? <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mwami na kabakumbuleti “Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, mpomwalikwinshila ibi kubanse bakame babula ncobabelepo, mwalikwinshila ame ndepele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi Mwami nakambile bali kucikasa cakucipiko, “Kamufumapa, amwe bashinganwa! Kamuyani kumulilo utapu uyo Lesa ngwabambila Muyungaushi ne bangelo bakendi baipa abo balapandukila Lesa! <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ndalikunyumfwa nsala, muliya kumpa cakulya. Ndalikunyumfwa nyotwa, muliya kumpa menshi akunwa. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ndalikuba mwensu muliya kuntambula kumanda enu, ndalikuba matakosha, muliya kumfwalika. Ndalikukolwa, kayi ndalikuba mujele, muliya kwisa kunyamfwilisha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Balo ni bakambeti, “Nkambo, Inga nililyoni mpotwalamubona kamumfwa nsala, nambi kamunyumfwa nyotwa, nambi kamuli matakosha. Twalanyumfwapo lilyoni eti mulakolwanga, nambi eti muli mujele afwe twalakana kumunyamfwilisha? <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nendi Mwami nakabakumbuleti, ‘Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, pacindi ncomwalikukana kunyamfwa banse bame babula ncobabelepo, mwalikukana kunyamfwa ame.’ <verse number="46" style="v"/>Popelapo nibakenga cisubula citapu, balo balulama kabaya kubuyumi bwamuyayaya.”</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Balapangananga kushina Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohane 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalapwisha kubeyisha makani awa, walabambila beshikwiya bakendi eti, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Mucinshi cena kwambeti papita masuba abili, kusekelela kwa Pasika nikutatike, neco Mwana Muntu nakatwalwe kuya kupopwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco, bamakulene beshimilumbo, ne bamakulene Baciyuda, balabungana mu ng'anda ya Mukulene wa Beshimilumbo bonse, lina lyakendi Kayafa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Balikupangana mobelela kumwikatila Yesu kwakubula nabambi kwinshiba ne kumushina. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nsombi balikwambeti, “Nkatwelela kumwikata mumasuba akusekelela Pasika sobwe, pakwinga ngapaba minyungwe pakati pabantu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mutukashi lananikinga mafuta Yesu ku Betaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliko 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohane 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalikuba ku Betaniya, mu ng'anda ya Shimoni shimankuntu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nomba mpobalikulya patebulu, palashika mutukashi walikuba wamanta nsupa mwalikuba mafuta anunkila amulo wadula, walatatika kwitila mafutawo pamutwi wa Yesu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba beshikwiya bakendi mpobalaboneco, balepilwa kwine, ne kwambeti, “Inga nikwataila cani cisa mafuta pabulyo.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Mafutawa ayandikanga kwaulisha mali angi, ne kunyamfwalishako bantu bapenshi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu pakwinshiba byonse mbyobalikwamba, walabepusheti, “Mulamupenshelenga cani mutukashi uyu? Ici ncalenshili ame caina.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Nimukutenga bantu bapenshi cindi conse, nsombi nteti munkutenga cindi conse sobwe, <verse number="12" style="v"/>nendi letili mafutawa pamubili pakame, ‘lananikili limo kantana mbikwa mu manda.’ <verse number="13" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, kulikonse uko bantu nkweshi bakakambaukenga Mulumbe uwu Waina pacishi conse, naco ici ncalenshi ni bakacambenga, kwambeti bantu bakanukilenga ponga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yudasi lapangananga ne bamakulene ba Bayuda,</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maliko 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi umo wabeshikwiya likumi ne babili, Yuda Sikalyote walaya kuli ba makulene beshimilumbo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ne kuya kubepusheti, “Inga nimumpe cani ndamulisha Yesu kuli njamwe?” Naboyo popelapo balabelenga mali a silifa makumi atatu ne kumupa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kufuma cindico, Yuda Sikalyote, walatatika kulangaula cindi celela ca kumwikatilapo Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi balalinga Pasika,</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maliko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohane 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pabusuba bwakutanguna bwakusekelela masuba ashinkwa wabula cishifufumusha, beshikwiya bakendi balesa kuli Yesu ne kumwipusheti, “Twenga kupeyo kuya kumubambila musena wa kulyelako Pasika?” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Kamuyani mu munshi uwu kumuntu wakuti wakuti, muye mwambeti, cindi cabo Bashikwiyisha cilipepi, balayandanga kwisa kulyela Pasika pamo ne beshikwiya babo kwenu.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Basa beshikwiya balensa mbuli Yesu ncalabambila, balabamba Pasika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mansailo mpokwalashipuluka, Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi likumi ne babili balekala patebulu ne kutatika kulya. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kabacilya, Yesu walabambileti, “Cakubinga ndamwambilishingeti, umo pali njamwe langulishinga kubalwani bakame.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Beshikwiya balanyumfwa nsoni, neco, balatatika kumwipusha Yesu, umo ne umo Nkambo, sena njame? <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Umo pali njamwe, uyo walyanga pamo nenjame mumbale iyi, epeloyo elangulishinga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>‘Mwana Muntu nafwe nditu, mbuli Mabala ncalambanga,’ Nomba ukute malele muntu laulishinga Mwana Muntu, ne calabako cena nalabula kusemwapo muntuyo.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yuda Sikalyote, usa walamulisha, walepusheti, “Bashikwiyisha, cakubinga nkandela kuba ame ngomulambanga ayi?” Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Ulamba omwine.”</para>
  <para style="s">Cakulya camansailo ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Bakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Cindi ncobalikulya, Yesu walamanta shinkwa walapaila ne kulumba Lesa, walakomona komona, walayabila beshikwiya, ne kwambeti, “Mantani, kamulyani, uwu emubili wakame.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kayi walamanta nkomeshi yesula waini, walalumba Lesa, ne kubapa beshikwiya basa, nekubambileti, “Kamunwa mwense. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Iyi emilopa yakame yacipangano iletikilinga bantu bangi kwambeti, balekelelwe bwipishi bwabo. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Cakubinga, nteti nkanwepo waini umbi, mpaka busuba mbweshi nkanwe waini walinolino pamo ne njamwe mu Bwami bwa Bata.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Panyuma pakwimbila lwimbo lwakutembaula Lesa, bonse balapula, balaya ku mulundu wa maolifi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambilingalimo eti Petulo nakamukane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohane 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu walabambila beshikwiya bakendi kwambeti, “Lelo mashiku mwense nimunkane ne kunshiya ndenka, pakwinga kwalembweti, ‘Ninkashine mwembeshi, kayi litanga lya mbelele nilikapalangane,’ <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nomba ndakapundushiwa kubafu, njameti nkatangune kuya ku Galileya.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nomba Petulo walambeti, “Nambi bonse bamukane ne kumushiya, ame ndenka nteti ndimukanepo pimbi.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Apo Yesu walamwambila Petulo, “Cakubinga ndakwambilishingeti, lyopele lelo mashiku, kombwe katanalila, obe nunkane tunkanda tutatu, kwambeti nkonjishipo sobwe.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nomba Petulo walambeti, “Nambi cambweti mfwe pamo nenjamwe nteti nkamukanepo sobwe.” Nabo beshikwiya bonse balamba cimo cimo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mupailo wa Yesu ku Getisemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliko 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi balaya kumusena walikukwiweti, Getisemani, uko nkwalakabambileti, “Kamwikalani pano, ame ndenga uko kuya kupaila.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Walamantako Petulo, ne banabendi Sebedayo babili, Yesu walongumana, ne kupenga mumoyo. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Walabambileti, “Mumoyo wakame muli bulanda bunene bwakufwa nabo. Kwamwikalani pano, nomba kamucetukani.” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu walaya pantangu ntamwa pang'ana, walawa kali wakotamika cinso cakendi panshi ne kutatika kupaila,walambeti, “Ta, na kacikonsheka, mufunye nkomeshi yamapensho iyi. Nsombi kakutaba kuyanda kwakame sobwe, nsombi kube kuyanda kwenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mpwalambeco, Yesu walabwelela kwalikuba beshikwiya basa, walabacana kabali bona tulo, neco walamwipusha Petulo, “Inga mulalilwaconi kupembelela pamo ne njame kwa kacindi kang'anowa. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Kumucetukani kayi kamupailani kwambeti kamutawila mu masunko. Walo moyo ulayandishishinga, nsombi mubili ulalefuku.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu walabashiya nekuya kankanda katubili kuya kupaila kambeti, “Ta, na nkomeshi ya mapensho iyi, nkayelela kumpitilila mpaka nwamo, naco caina, kuyanda kwinshike.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mpwalabwelako kayi walabacana kabali bona tulo, pakwinga bikope byabo byalalema ne tulo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu walabashiya walaya kupaila katunkanda tutatu, kamba maswi amo amo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi, walesa kuli beshikwiya bakendi basa ne kwambeti, “Ne lino mucili monatulo, ne kupumwina ‘Cindi cilashiki,’ Mwana Muntu nabikwe mu makasa abantu baipa.” <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Pundukani! Tiyeni! Nte uyu shikungulisha lashiki!”</para>
  <para style="s">Balamwikatanga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohane 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu kacamba, Yuda Sikalyote, umo wa beshikwiya likumi ne babili walashika ne likoto lyabantu kabali bamanta bibeshi ne mingwala. Bamakulene beshimilumbo, ne bamakulene ba Bayuda ebalabatuma aba bantu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Shikumulisha wali kalilabambili kendi cishibisho, kwambeti, “Uyo ngweshi nshonshonte, endiye ngomulayandanga, mumwikate!” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yuda Sikalyote walalulama palikuba Yesu ne kwambeti, Mitende Bashikwiyisha! Mpwalambeco walamushonshonta. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Obe ndo fwambana kwinsa ncoleshili.” Popelapo basa bantu Yesu balamutanya ne kumusunga. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Nomba kamubonani! umo walikuba pamo ne Yesu walapulisha cibeshi, ne kumutimbula litwi musebenshi wa Shimilumbo mukulene. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walamwambileti, “Bwesha cibeshico mucikwama, pakwinga bonse balasebenseshenga bibeshi, nibakafwe ku bibeshi,” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Sena ulayeyengeti nkandelela kukuwa ne kusenga Bata, balo pacindi copele cino ngabantumina bangelo bankondo bapita makoto likumi ne abili. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Na ame nyinseco, ngabinshikeconi byalambwa mu Mabala kwambeti byelela kwinshika. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Popelapo, bantu basa Yesu walabepusheti, “Nipacebo cini mulaletelele bibeshi ne mingwala, pakunjikata eti njame kapondo? Masuba onse ndekalanga nenu mu Ng'anda ya Lesa kanjiyisha.” <verse number="56" style="v"/>“Nomba ibi byonse bilenshiki kwambeti mbyobalalemba bashinshimi mu Mabala bikwanilishiwe.” Popelapo beshikwiya bakendi bonse balafwamba, ne kumushiya Yesu enka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu labonekelenga ku Nkuta inene yaba Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maliko 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohane 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Bantu basa mpobalamwikata Yesu, balamutwala ku ng'anda ya Kayafa Mukulene wa beshimilumbo bonse, uko nkobalabungana beshikwiyisha Milawo ya Mose, ne bamakulene ba Bayuda. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Petulo, walikakonka panyuma capataliko, mpaka walakengila mukati mulubuwa lwa ng'anda ya Mukulene wa beshimilumbo usa. Walengila mukati ne kuya kwikala pamo ne bamalonda baku Ng'anda ya Lesa, kwambeti abone ceti cinshike. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Beshimilumbo bamakulene, ne bonse bamu Nkuta inene ya Bayuda, bali kulangaula bakamboni bela kumubepeshela Yesu kwambeti bamushine. <verse number="60" style="v"/>Nikukabeti palesa bakamboni bangi bela kumubepeshela, nsombi baliya kucanapo bukamboni bwancinencine mbobalikulangaula. Kumapwililisho kwalesa bantu babili, <verse number="61" style="v"/>balambeti, “Muntuyu walikwambeti, ame ndelela kumwaya Ng'anda ya Lesa, ne kuyibaka kayi mu masuba atatu owa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Lino Mukulene wa beshimilumbo bonse walemana ne kumwipusha Yesu. “Sena uliya cakukumbulapo pa bintu ibi mbyobalakubepeshenga aba bantu?” <verse number="63" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu nendi walamwenowa tonto. Kayi Mukulene wa beshimilumbo bonse usa walambila Yesu, “Ndakwambilinga mu Lina lya Lesa muyumi, kwambeti winse kulumbila pakwamba na njobe Klistu, Mwanendi Lesa.” <verse number="64" style="v"/>Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Mulamba mobene, nsombi ndamwambilishingeti, ‘kufuma cino cindi nimukabone Mwana Muntu kaliwekala kucikasa calulyo ca Lesa wangofu shonse,’ Nimukamubone kesa mwilu mumakumbi.” <verse number="65" style="v"/>Mukulene wa beshimilumbobonse walatwamuna munganjo wakendi kulesha bukalu ne kwambeti, “Uku ni kumunyansha Lesa ‘Sena paciyandika bakamboni nabambi’ Mulalinyumfwili mobene ncalamunyansha Lesa.” <verse number="66" style="v"/>“Neco mulayeyengapongeconi?” Balo balakumbuleti, “Lacaniki ne mulandu, welela kushinwa!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>Popelapo balatatika kumusankila mata kumenso ne kumuma mpaka, nabambi balatatika kumuma makofi, <verse number="68" style="v"/>kabambeti, “Obe Klistu, Kolotela, inga lakumu niyani?”</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo lakananga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maliko 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohane 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Petulo walakekala mulubuwa kunsa kwa ng'anda. Mutukashi musebenshi wa Mukulene wa beshimilumbo walesa kulyendiye ne kwambeti, “Ne njamwe mwalikwenda pamo ne Yesuyu waku Galileya.” <verse number="70" style="v"/>Nsombi nendi walakana pamenso abantu bonse, walambeti, “Ncolambanga ame nkandicishipo sobwe!” <verse number="71" style="v"/>Petulo mpwalikupula kaya pacishinga, kayi mutukashi naumbi musebenshi walamubona, walatatika kwambila nabambi balikubapo. “Uyu muntu walikuba pamo ne Yesu waku Nasaleti.” <verse number="72" style="v"/>Petulo walakana, cakwinsa kulumbileti, “Cakubinga ame nkandimwishipo muntuyo.” <verse number="73" style="v"/>Mpopalapitako kacindi kang'ana, bantu balikubapo balamwambila Petulo, “Kwelana ne ntaka ya ng'ambilo yakobe tuleshibinga kwambeti ne njobe owa mulikoto ili.” <verse number="74" style="v"/>Apo Petulo walensa kulumbileti, “Lesa anshingane ne kumpa cisubulo, na ndambanga bwepeshi, ame muntuyu nkandimwishipo sobwe.” Cindi copeleco kombwe walalila. <verse number="75" style="v"/>Petulo walanuka maswi ngalamwambila Yesu akwambeti, “Kombwe katanalila nukankane tunkanda tutatu kwambeti nkonjishipo sobwe.” Popelapo Petulo walapula kayakulila ne kushinshimuka.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Balamutwalanga Yesu kuli Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maliko 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohane 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mpobwalaca mumene, beshimilumbo bonse, ne bamakulene Baciyuda balapangana kayi sha kumushina Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Balamusunga ne kumutwala kuli Pilato Mwendeleshi wa Ciloma.</para>
  <para style="s">Lufu lwa Yuda Sikalyote Yohane 18:39 mpaka 19:16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yuda, usa walaulisha Yesu mpwalaboneti mulandu ulaba wakumushina Yesu, walalisenda mwine, neco walababweshela bamakulene beshimilumbo, ne bamakulene Baciyuda, mali asa akwana makumi atatu a silifa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Walambeti, “Ndepisha kulisha muntu wabula mulandu kwambeti ayafwe.” Nomba balo balambeti, “Ulayandanga twinseconi? Awo nimakani akobe omwine.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yuda walamanta mali ne kuya kwawala mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, kufumapo wakalisungilila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Basa bamakulene beshimilumbo balabwesa mali, ne kwambeti, “Milawo yetu nkayasuminisha kwabika mali awa mu kabokoshi nkotukute kubikamo mali muno mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, pakwinga ni mali amilopa.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Neco balapanganeti mali awa baule libala lya mubumbi wanongo, kwambeti kube kunamaumbwe abensu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi libala ilyo mpaka lelo likute kukwiweti libala lya milopa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Neco, kwalikuba kukwanilisha calamba mushinshimi Yelemiya uyo walambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“balamanta asa mali makumi atatu amukuba,</para>
  <para style="q">mulo bana Baislayeli ngobalapangana palyendiye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>balaula libala lya mubumbi wanongo, mbuli Lesa ncalang'ambila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Pilato lepushunga Yesu mipusho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maliko 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohane 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walemana pamenso pa Pilato Mwendeleshi, uyo walamwipusheti, “Sena njobe Mwami wa Bayuda?” Yesu walakumbuleti, “Mulamba mobene.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nomba mpobali kumubepesha bamakulene beshimilumbo, ne bamakulene Baciyuda, Yesu nkali kubakumbulapo sobwe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pilato mpwalaboneco, walamwipusha Yesu, “Sena nkolabinyumfunga mbyobala kubepeshenga?” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu uliya kumukumbula. Neco Pilato walakankamana kwine.</para>
  <para style="s">Pilato lapingulungeti Yesu afwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maliko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pacindi cakusekelela Pasika, Mwendeleshi Pilato, walikukute cinga cakusungulula kaili umo, uyo bantu ngobalayandanga. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwalikuba kaili umo pacindico wayampuyo, walikuwiweti Balaba. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mpobalabungana, Pilato walabepusheti, “Inga mulayandanga upeyo ngoti nsungulule, ‘Balaba,’ Nambi Yesu, lakwiwangeti Klistu?” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Walambeco pakwinga walikwinshiba kwambeti, bantu balamuleta Yesu kulyendiye cebo ca minyono yabo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pilato kacili wekala pa cipuna cakomboloshela milandu, mukashendi walamutumina maswi, walambeti, “Kamutengililapo pankani ya muntuyo walulama, ame lelo mashiku ndapenge ne maloto pacebo ca muntuyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bamakulene beshimilumbo, ne bamakulene Baciyuda, balatatika kuyungaula bantu kwambeti, basenge Pilato asungulule Balaba, ne kwambeti Yesu afwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lino Pilato walabepusheti, “Pa bantu babili aba mulayandanga ndimusungulwilepo upeyo?” Balo balambeti, “Balaba!” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kayi Pilato walabepusheti, “Inga lino uyu Yesu, lakwiwangeti, Klistu ndimwinseconi?” Bantu bonse balambeti, “Mupopeni!” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kayi Pilato, walabepusheti, “Inga ukute mulandu cini?” Bantu basa balapitilisha kubilikisheti, “Mupopeni!” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lino Pilato mpwalaboneti bantu ngabatatika mipyopyongano, na upitilisha kwambapo, walamanta menshi, walasamba kumakasa pamenso pabantu bonse. Walambeti, “Ame ndiya mulandu wa lufu lwa muntuyu. Mulandu niwenu mobene.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Basa bantu bonse pamo balambeti, “Mulandu walufulo ube pamitwi yetu ne ya bana betu.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Popelapo Pilato walabasungulwila Balaba, ne kumukwapula Yesu, panyuma pakendi balamutwala kuya kumupopa palusanda.</para>
  <para style="s">Bashilikali balapenshenga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maliko 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohane 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Popelapo bashilikali ba Mwendeleshi Pilato, balamumanta Yesu, nekuya nendi mulubuwa lwang'anda ya Pilato. Umo mobalabunganya bashilikali banabo ne kumushunguluka Yesu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Balamufulula byakufwala byakendi, ne kumufwalika mwinjila ufubeluka. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Balapomba munshini wamyunga ne kumufwalika kumutwi, kayi balamwikatisha nkoli ya litete kucikasa cakululyo, balatatika kumusuntamina kwakumuwela, ne kumufukanya mwalisongwe, kabambeti, “Mitende Mwami wa Bayuda.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Balamusankila mata, balamanta nkoli yalitete ne kumuma nayo mu mutwi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mpobalacileka kumufukanya mwalisongwe, balamufulula mwinjila ufubeluka usa, ne kumufwalika mwinjila wakendi. Panyuma pakendi balamumanta kuya kumupopa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapopwanga palusanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohane 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Cindi ncobalikufuma mu munshi umo, balakumanya muntu, lina lyakendi, Shimoni waku Kulene. Bashilikali balamukakatisha kunyamuna lusanda lwa Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Balashika pamusena walikukwiweti, Gologota, ekwambeti musena wacifupa camutwi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Uko nkobalamupa Yesu, waini wasankanishiwako ne ntulukishi, kwambeti anwe. Nomba mpwalasupitamo, walakana kunwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu mpobalamupopa pa lusanda, balauma nsolo kwambeti baboneti nibani beti bayabane byakufwala byakendi, <verse number="36" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi balekala panshi kabamupembelela. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pelu pamutwi wakendi Yesu, balalembapo mulandu ngobalamushinina, balalembeti, “Uyu e Yesu Mwami wa Bayuda.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kayi kopeloko kwalikuba kwapopwa kapondo babili, umo kucikasa ca kululyo, naumbi kucikasa ca kucipiko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nomba bantu balikupita pepi bali kumutukana, kabapukumuna mitwi yabo, <verse number="40" style="v"/>kabambeti, “Sena obe ntobe walikwambeti, ‘Ni nkamwaye Ng'anda ya Lesa, ne kuyibaka pamasuba atatu’ Na cakubinga njobe Mwanendi Lesa, kolipulusha ufumepo pa lusandapo.” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nabo bamakulene beshimilumbo pamo ne beshikwiyisha milawo ya Mose, ne bamakulene Baciyuda, balikumuseka kabambeti, <verse number="42" style="v"/>Walikupulusha bantu bambi, nsombi lalilwanga kulipulusha mwine, sena nte Mwami wa Baislayeli? Kaselukapo pa lusandapo kwambeti afwe tumushome. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Walikuba wacinka manungo muli Lesa, kamupulushani Lesa uyo na umusuni nte walikambeti, “Njame Mwanendi Lesa!” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nabo kapondo babili basa balikuba bapopwa pamo ne Yesu balikumutukana.</para>
  <para style="s">Kufwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohane 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kufuma cindi ca muma 12 koloko mpaka 3 koloko munshi palaba mushinshe pacishi conse. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Cindi camuma 3 koloko munshi, Yesu walabilikisheti, “Eloi, Eloi, Lama sabakatani?” Uku ekwambeti, “Lesa wakame, Lesa wakame, mulanshili cani ndenka!” <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nabambi balikuba bemana pepi mpobalanyumfwa maswi awo balambeti, “Muntuyu lakunga Eliya.” <verse number="48" style="v"/>Popelapo naumbi walafwamba kuya kumanta cisambo, walacisabika mu waini wasasa, ne kucibika ku kalutele ne kumupa kwambeti anwe. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nsombi nabambi balambeti, “Koleka nanshi, tubone na Eliya nese amupulushe!” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu walakuluma cangofu, popelapo walataya moyo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Lino kamubonani, cisa cikwisa calikuba mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, calatwamuka pakati kufumina pelu mpaka panshi. Kwalaba mukunkumo, ne mabwe alapasauka. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Manda alacaluka ne mibili yabantu ba Lesa bangi bona mu manda balapundushiwa. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Mpolabapula mu manda, Panyuma pa kupunduka kwa Yesu, balaya kwingila mu Yelusalemu Mushi Waswepa. Ne kuboneka ku bantu bangi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Abo balikuba ne mushilikali mukulene kabapembelela Yesu, mpobalabona mukunkumo ne bintu nabimbi byalenshika, balaba ne buyowa bunene, balambeti, “Cakubinga muntuyu wanga Mwanendi Lesa.” <verse number="55" style="v"/>Palikuba batukashi bangi balikuba bemana capataliko balikwebelela. Aba ebalamukonkela Yesu kufuma ku Galileya, kabamunyamfwilisha. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Pakati pabatukashi aba palikuba Maliya waku Magadala, Maliya banyina Jemusi ne Yosefe, ne mukashendi Sebedayo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu labikwanga mu manda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohane 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Cindi camansailo pamuntu ngulya, kwalashika Yosefe waku Alimateya, walikuba mubile, neye walikuba shikwiya wa Yesu. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Walaya kusenga mubili wa Yesu kuli Pilato, nendi Pilato walasuminisheti, Yosefe apewe uwo mubili. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Neco Yosefe walamanta mubili ne kufungaila mucikwisa caswepa calinolino cituba, <verse number="60" style="v"/>ne kuya kubika mu manda ngwalalibesela calinolino mulibwe ne kunkulushilapo cilibwe pacishinga camanda ne kufumako. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Maliya waku Magadala, ne Maliya naumbi usa balikuba bekala panshi kabali balangila kumanda.</para>
  <para style="s">Bamalonda pamanda a Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Mpobwalaca mumene pa Sabata, bamakulene beshimilumbo, pamo ne Bafalisi balakabungana kuli Pilato <verse number="63" style="v"/>ne kumwambileti, “Nkambo, twanuka kwambeti kacili muyumi muntu mubepeshi usa, walikwambeti, ‘Pakapita masuba atatu ninkapundushiwe.’ <verse number="64" style="v"/>Neco, kamubambilani bamalonda benga bapembelele pamanda kwa masuba atatu, kutineti kabatesa bamwibe beshikwiya bakendi, ne kutatika kwambila bantu, eti lapundushiwa kubafu. Pakwinga kubepa uku ngakukonempa kupita kubepa kusa kwakutanguna.” <verse number="65" style="v"/>Nendi Pilato walabambileti, “Nenjamwe mukute bamalonda, mucinshi ncomwelela kwinsa, kamuyani mupembelele pamandapo.” <verse number="66" style="v"/>Balaya, balashinkashinka pamanda ne kushapo cishibisho pacilibweco. Ne kushiyapo bamalonda babo.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapundukunga kubafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maliko 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohane 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Busuba bwa Sabata ya Bayuda mpobwalapita, Maliya waku Magadala ne Maliya naumbi, mumenemene kapacili pashipuluka pasondo, balaya kusula kumanda. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kabatana bashikako kwalenshika mukunkumo unene, pakwinga mungelo wa Lesa walafuma kwilu walakunkulushila pambali cilibwe cisa ne kwikalapo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Walikuboneketi lulabo kayi byakufwala byakendi byalikuba byatuba tuu! <verse number="4" style="v"/>Bamalonda basa balatina, kayi balatatika kututuma, balayuminina ntaa! eti bantu bafwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nomba mungeloyo walabambila batukashi baseti, “Kamutatina sobwe! Ndicinshi mulalangaulunga Yesu usa ngobanga bapopa palusanda, <verse number="6" style="v"/>muliya muno sobwe lapundushiwa mbuli ncalikwamba. ‘Kamwisani mubone mpwanga wona.’ <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kamuyani bwangu mwenga mwambile beshikwiya bakendi kwambeti, ‘lapundushiwa kubafu,’ Kayi latangunu kendi kuya ku Galileya kopeloko nimwenga mubonane nendi, mwanukenga ibi mbyondamwambili.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Batukashi basa balafumako bwangu kumanda, kabali ne buyowa, nomba kayi kabali bakondwa cikamba, balafwamba kuya kwambila beshikwiya bakendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mwakutengashila Yesu walakumana nabo ne kubambileti, “Mitende batukashi amwe!” Nabo balesa pepi,balasuntama ne kumwikata kumyendo yakendi ne kumukambilila. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Kamutatina, kamuyani mwambile banse bame benga ku Galileya. Nitubonane kopeloko.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mbyobalakamba bamalonda basa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Cindi ncobalikuya batukashi basa, bamalonda nabambi balashika ku Yelusalemu kuya kwambila beshimilumbo bamakulene bintu byonse byalenshika. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lino beshimilumbo bamakulene basa, ne bamakulene Baciyuda, balabungana pamo kupana mano. Bamalonda basa balabapa mali angi, <verse number="13" style="v"/>ne kubambileti, “Mwambengeti, beshikwiya bakendi besakwiba citumbi mashiku, afwe katuli tona tulo.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na Mwendeleshi wamfulumende anyumfwe ibi, afwe nitumwikalike cali, paliya mulandu ngoshimupewe sobwe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>balatambula mali bamalonda basa, kayi balensa mbuli ncobalabambila. Awa makani alayampuwo pakati pa Bayuda mpaka lelo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu latumunga beshikwiya bakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohane 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Incito 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Beshikwiya likumi ne umo balaya ku Galileya, kumulundu uko Yesu nkwalabambileti benga bakakumane nendi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mpobalamubona, balamukambilila, nsombi nabambi balikutonshanya. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu walesa pepi ne kubambileti, “Ngofu shonse shabwendeleshi kwilu ne pacishi capanshi shilapewa kulinjame. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Anu lino kamuyani kubantu bamishobo yonse, mwenga mubeyishe babe beshikwiya bakame. Mukababatishenga mu lina lya Bata ne mu lina lya Mwana, kayi ne lya Mushimu Uswepa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mukabeyishenga kukonkela bintu byonse mbyondamwambili, kayi nimbenga ne njamwe masuba onse, mpaka mapwililisho acishi.”</para>
</usx>
